&lt;p&gt;As a Billing Specialist, your responsibilities will include managing the team&#39;s mailbox, processing purchase orders, handling customer onboarding requests, uploading portal invoices, invoicing for both professional services and SaaS. You will collaborate with various departments such as Collection, Finance Operations, and Deal Desk to achieve shared objectives. The role requires good independent judgment to evaluate and resolve unique situations effectively.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
