&lt;li&gt;Upload invoices to portals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support daily team communications as requests for action are received in the team inbox.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process financial documents, invoices, and purchase orders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for accurate and timely invoicing and related administrative tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate invoices for both professional services and SaaS offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively collaborate with Collection, Finance Operations, and Deal Desk teams to ensure smooth processes and achieve common goals.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
