&lt;li&gt;Business fluency in English as a Must-have&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communications skills to deal with different internal stakeholders and in multinational teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Very comfortable with numbers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Target driven, quick leaner and team player.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An independent and entrepreneurial way of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Located in Madrid to work one-site from the Celonis Madrid office.&lt;/li&gt;
