&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enrolled student or Graduated Bachelor in Computer Science, Artificial Intelligence, Data Science, HCI, Design, Service Design, Product Design or Interaction,&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interest in in the intersection of Business, Design and applied agentic AI.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
