&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Map Enterprise Digital Twins:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee the deployment of the Celonis Process Intelligence Graph to build systemic, end-to-end operational models of complex oilfield, pipeline, or refining enterprises.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrate $100M+ Business Cases:&lt;/strong&gt; Direct the formulation of board-ready Celonis Value Assessments, delivering the economic justification, working capital improvements, and OPEX returns required to greenlight massive cloud, IoT, and Edge AI investments.&lt;/li&gt;
