&lt;li&gt;Experience selling enterprise software at C-level to accounts in LATAM in a new business focused field sales role (CFO, CPO, COO…)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage long and complex sales cycles with multiple stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have proven experience working with Partners, i.e. Consulting firms and Enterprise Tech&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to adapt to a fast moving, ever changing, high growth environment and approach challenges with positivity, creative thinking, and a growth mindset&lt;/li&gt;
