&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-459&quot;&gt;You will be joining the Knowledge Management team, a specialized unit sitting within Corporate Engagement &amp;amp; Programs (CEP)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;8,5&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-458&quot;&gt;CEP is a highly collaborative, global department with team members spanning Bangalore, Munich, Madrid, and the US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;8,7&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;8,9&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-457&quot;&gt;Our Knowledge Management is fundamentally focused on a critical, forward-looking mission: bringing our vast organizational knowledge up to date across more than 20 distinct tools to ensure it is fully AI-ready&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;8,11&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;8,13&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-456&quot;&gt;Based in our Bangalore office, you will operate in a dynamic environment characterized by extensive cross-departmental work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;8,15&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
