&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a motivated and curious intern to join our Marketing Production &amp;amp; Creative Operations&amp;nbsp;team at Celonis. In this role, you will be an integral part of our digital asset management operations,helping us organize, maintain, and optimize our asset libraries across two key platforms: Adobe&amp;nbsp;Experience Manager (AEM), Wistia and Monday.com work management.&amp;nbsp;This is a hands-on role with real responsibility from day one. You&#39;ll work closely with our production&amp;nbsp;team and get a deep understanding of how a global B2B tech company manages its creative and video&amp;nbsp;assets at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A 6-month full-time internship with real ownership and meaningful work from day one&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Direct exposure to how a global B2B tech company manages creative production at scale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A collaborative and international team that values initiative and good ideas&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with industry-leading tools like Adobe Experience Manager, Wistia and&amp;nbsp;Monday.com work management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Mentoring and regular feedback to support your professional development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
