&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Support the day-to-day management of our digital asset library in Adobe Experience Manager (AEM),&amp;nbsp;including uploading, tagging, organizing, and maintaining assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Manage and maintain our video asset library in Wistia, including metadata, organization, and access&amp;nbsp;management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Help develop and improve asset taxonomy, naming conventions, and folder structures to keep our&amp;nbsp;DAM systems clean and scalable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with internal stakeholders (designers, marketers, production managers) to ensure assets&amp;nbsp;are findable and up to date&lt;/li&gt;
