&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A basic understanding of digital tools and platforms – you&#39;re comfortable navigating new software and learning quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Strong organizational skills and attention to detail – you enjoy bringing structure to complexity&lt;/li&gt;
