&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6–10+ years of experience in Finance, Cloud Economics, FP&amp;amp;A, Strategic Finance, Business Operations, Engineering Operations, Data Analytics, or a related analytical role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, including advanced spreadsheet modeling and experience working with large datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Python or an equivalent scripting language for data analysis, automation, and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
