&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements Definition:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate complex legal and regulatory requirements into clear, actionable user stories and product specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go-to-Market:&lt;/strong&gt; Support Bids &amp;amp; Proposals and Sales Enablement by providing product expertise related to security, compliance, and public sector-specific features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of Product Management experience, preferably with a B2B SaaS product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience working within or extensively selling/developing for &lt;strong&gt;regulated industries&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., Financial Services, Healthcare) or the &lt;strong&gt;Public Sector/Government&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Familiarity with private cloud, hybrid cloud, or self-managed deployment models and the unique operational challenges they present.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of security frameworks, data governance, and regulatory compliance requirements relevant to cloud software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great knowledge of cloud native software stacks, such as Kubernetes and Object storage, and how to apply them in a self-hosted, regulated industry environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills with the ability to articulate complex technical and regulatory topics to diverse audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Degree/Certification, e.g., Bachelor’s degree in a relevant field.]&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with specific certifications like FedRAMP, SOC 2, or industry-specific regulatory frameworks is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud infrastructure services and cloud native infrastructure abstractions such as Kubernetes and Object Storage is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
