&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-3 years of digital marketing experience. 1-2 years in agency setting preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 2 years of hands-on experience with Amazon / Retail search advertising, Google paid search advertising, or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant campaign management experience in one or more of the following additional campaign types:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
