&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full ownership and execution of performance marketing via paid social platforms
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively executing builds and production A-Z with redundancy across channels
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Channels include TikTok, Meta, Pinterest, Snapchat, Reddit, and LinkedIn where applicable. Heavier emphasis on TikTok and Meta&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead execution of optimizations concerning performance improvements relative to goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively own strategic communication internally and externally for clients and client teams
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive internal communication with team on performance, strategy, recommendations, deliverables, and action items&lt;/li&gt;
