&lt;p&gt;Managing billions in media, our dynamic team––of consultative marketers, creatives, analysts and technologists––challenge traditional ways of planning and measurement through meticulous testing and data science across each milestone of the customer journey.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;*This is a paid internship with the possibility of working on-site or Hybrid at our Medellin Office&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
