&lt;li&gt;Consistently drive efficiencies within the current measurement and marketing science processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employ AI technologies to increase efficiency and support the optimization of deliverables and/or processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize and leverage Power Digital&#39;s Nova ecosystem as it relates to your department&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
