&lt;li&gt;Highly dependable individual who thrives in a fast-paced environment and is a self-starter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem solving, communication, and decision-making skills; ability to clearly communicate complex strategies to senior leadership and executive-level stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team-oriented and collaborative, effective interpersonal skills, highly organized&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;cData visualization skills using Looker and analysis in Excel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and as part of a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
