&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 5 years of experience in an SEO-based role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced understanding of all aspects of organic search including on-page, technical, off-page, and SEO Content. Aligning SEO and Content efforts with priority business focuses. Work autonomously to think outside the box and craft custom organic search strategies as needed to help clients achieve their goals in an attempt to maintain client retention&lt;/li&gt;
