&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Who We Are:&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a tech-enabled growth firm–at the intersection of marketing, consulting &amp;amp; data intelligence–igniting revenue and brand recognition for leading and emerging companies around the world. As a people-first firm, we value diversity in backgrounds and experiences. We strongly believe our people and culture are key to our success. Our vision is to be recognized as the most valued and respected private growth marketing firm in the world–with a scalable brand, culture and services. Our mission is to power the relentless pursuit of growth and redefine what’s possible through a team of growth-obsessed experts who demand innovation and results - driven by integrity, autonomy, and grit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a full-service growth marketing firm, we offer best-in-class services including: SEO, Content Marketing, Paid Media, Social Media Marketing, Programmatic + CTV, Public Relations, Influencer Marketing, Email + SMS, Conversion Rate Optimization, Retail Marketing, and Creative. Here at Power Digital, we are hyper-focused on helping brands drive revenue growth and brand recognition, ultimately driving irrefutable value for our clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the heart of Power Digital is our proprietary technology, nova, which analyzes businesses through first-party data, simplifying investment planning for marketing and diligence in M&amp;amp;A––putting marketers in a strategic seat at the table––and providing value in unparalleled ways.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Managing billions in media, our dynamic team––of consultative marketers, creatives, analysts and technologists––challenge traditional ways of planning and measurement through meticulous testing and data science across each milestone of the customer journey.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;***Proficiency in spoken and written English at an advanced level is required for this role.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A day in the life:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Talent Acquisition Specialist, you’ll be hands-on in keeping our fast-paced recruitment engine running efficiently. Each day, you’ll manage candidate pipelines across multiple roles, coordinate interviews, and ensure timely, thoughtful communication with every candidate. You’ll work closely with recruiters and hiring managers—taking full ownership of tasks like resume vetting, proactive outreach, daily screening calls, and end-to-end interview coordination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Staying organized, moving with urgency, and delivering accurate reporting will be essential to your success. You&#39;ll also play a key role in sourcing efforts, using creativity and strategy to attract top talent across the U.S. and LATAM. Whether you’re building strong candidate benches or supporting diversity-focused initiatives, your contributions will directly shape the future of hiring at Power Digital.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support high-volume recruitment by managing candidate sourcing, profile tracking, job postings, and interview coordination in Greenhouse (ATS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Schedule and reschedule interviews across multiple rounds with hiring managers, department leaders, and the executive team based on calendar availability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure timely and clear candidate communication, maintaining a 24-hour turnaround time for interview scheduling and next-step follow-ups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide candidates through the hiring pipeline with speed, accuracy, and a focus on delivering a positive experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with hiring managers throughout the recruitment process and co-lead bi-weekly People Planning meetings to align on hiring priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the employee referral process&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide TA, HR, and executive leadership with accurate and timely ad hoc reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion and participate in Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion initiatives and identify areas of opportunity to improve equity in hiring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Talent Acquisition internship program and assist with special projects as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employ AI technologies to enhance and optimize business processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize and leverage Power Digital&#39;s Nova ecosystem as it relates to your department&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in a dynamic, fast-paced environment and adapts readily to evolving priorities and growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to excel both independently and collaboratively within a team setting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meticulous attention to detail and unwavering commitment to accuracy in all tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in a customer service role, demonstrating strong communication, problem-solving, and interpersonal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional verbal and written communication skills, coupled with strong interpersonal abilities to build rapport with diverse stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Superior time management and organizational skills, with the ability to prioritize effectively and meet deadlines consistently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Values driving diverse talent and proactively building talent networks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to recruitment and/or HR&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in spoken and written English at an advanced level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Performance Indicators (KPIs)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;KPI #1 - Manage inbound talent pools across 5+ roles&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;KPI #2 - Maintain an average time-to-fill of 45 days or less for all open requisitions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;KPI #3 - Support recruitment team with quick and accurate scheduling of next steps for candidates within 24 hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
