&lt;p&gt;As a Web Developer in our healthcare division you sit at the intersection of creative and technical, turning designs into fast, polished, high-performing web experiences. In this role, you&#39;ll partner closely with designers and project managers to build and maintain WordPress-based websites that move the needle for our clients. You&#39;ll bring both the craft and the judgment to make the right call on performance, security, and code quality, and you&#39;ll do it in an environment that&#39;s constantly pushing what&#39;s possible with technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, customize, and maintain WordPress websites including custom themes and plugins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate visual designs into functional, responsive, cross-browser experiences using HTML, CSS, SASS, JavaScript, and PHP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate external APIs into new and existing websites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test and debug websites to ensure performance, security, and accessibility standards are met&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement SEO best practices at the technical level to support organic performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize and leverage Power Digital&#39;s Nova ecosystem as it relates to your department&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of web development experience with a strong focus on WordPress (custom theme and plugin development)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in HTML, CSS, SASS, JavaScript, and PHP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid grasp of responsive design, web standards, and accessibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with GitHub and GitHub Actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with server administration and hosting environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with healthcare websites or HIPAA encryption standards &lt;strong&gt;is a plus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Webflow, Drupal, React, Angular, Twig, or Node &lt;strong&gt;is a plus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employ AI technologies to enhance and optimize business processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize and leverage Power Digital&#39;s Nova ecosystem as it relates to your department&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other applicable or related duties as assigned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
