&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Record, classify, and reconcile transactions across AP, AR, payroll, and journals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Prepare and review monthly reconciliations for bank, vendors, customers, and GL accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Ensure compliance with local tax regulations and support tax filings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Prepare monthly, quarterly, and annual financial statements and management reports under GAAP/IFRS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Support month-end and year-end close, including accruals and adjustments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Provide accurate data and variance insights for budgeting and forecasting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Partner with external auditors; prepare schedules and supporting documentation&lt;/li&gt;
