&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;As an &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Account Director&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll own the relationship portfolio of one of our biggest, high-profile clients, ensuring long-term success, exceptional service delivery, and profitable growth. You will understand the opportunity and value of technology to clients, directing teams, projects, and deliverables in line with a future-facing, AI-enabled offering that impacts the end-to-end delivery process. We are looking for someone who is passionate about seeking new opportunities to create impactful work.&lt;/p&gt;
