&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Please note that we will never request payment or bank account information at any stage of the recruitment process. As we continue to grow our teams, we urge you to be cautious of fraudulent job postings or recruitment activities that misuse our company name and information. Please protect your personal information during any recruitment process. While Monks may contact potential candidates via LinkedIn, all applications must be submitted through our official website (&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;monks.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As an Account Manager at Monks you will work with our stellar team to manage analytics projects and media campaigns for a portfolio of clients. This is a consultative role advising clients on ways to harness different technology solutions, and optimize their digital media performance to drive long-term value - mainly through Google Analytics and Google Marketing Platforms. Technology is outpacing our client&#39;s abilities to adopt and implement these tools so clients look to our team for their strategic knowledge of the digital space coupled with our platform know-how to bring results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities will include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The key responsibilities of this role are account management, and digital media implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing client relationships and providing ongoing account management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding clients’ marketing technology, and providing support and expertise to help them maximise their use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical and strategic support to clients to help them get the best results from their advertising activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing analysis, insight, and expertise for clients on our products and offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop initiatives and tactics designed to drive incremental spend within the client patch and the wider team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital Media Implementation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implementation of digital media campaigns across display, video, mobile, social and search advertising.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyzing data for reporting and optimizing advertising campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing recommendations to clients to improve results of their digital media campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring to it:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successful candidates will have 2-3 years experience in digital media buying platforms and account management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience managing campaigns, specifically, setting up, optimizing &amp;amp; reporting on a DSP or search engines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data analysis abilities, attention to detail &amp;amp; verbal and written communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferred skills in a number of the following: Display &amp;amp; Video 360, Campaign Manager, TTD, Google Ads, Microsoft Search Engine (previously Bing), Meta, Snapchat, TikTok, Twitter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Planning experience preferred but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional ability to learn, adapt, discover and test new ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desire to work in a fast-paced, high-pressure, and fun startup environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive salary &amp;amp; benefits package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to be a part of and contribute to the success of a market disruptor in the advertising industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We provide a robust learning program to train on cross-platform (Programmatic, Search &amp;amp; Social platforms).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Well supported role in a growing team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a welcoming, ambitious, and collaborative team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
