&lt;p&gt;We are looking to bring on an Account Manager with experience managing teams and clients, along with a strong desire to develop and enhance our business operations and process. Get in on something special, have a meaningful impact, and help our business grow by helping our clients grow and be rewarded with uncapped professional growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a strategic consultative partner, the Account Manager will advise Media.Monks clients on industry trends and ways to harness different technology solutions to drive long-term value. Successful candidates for this opportunity will demonstrate strategic thinking, and team development and client management skills that go beyond platform knowledge.&lt;/p&gt;
