&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Campaign design &amp;amp; management within advanced programmatic advertising platforms for display, mobile, social, video, analytics, ad serving, and creative design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Data analysis for reporting and optimizing advertising campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Providing analysis, insight, and expertise for clients on our products and offerings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
