&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;3-5 years experience executing Programmatic campaigns in a technology company or end-advertiser.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Knowledge and interest in advertising technologies, trends and where the industry may be headed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Advanced DV360, CM, Amazon, and The Trade Desk knowledge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Ability and desire to scale knowledge and learning to other junior (and at times senior) team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Expert written and verbal communication&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and consulting skills, rooted in the ability to draw and communicate insights from multiple data points&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ambition to perform unprecedented tasks and obtain new skills, be comfortable with uncertainty and adapt to a rapidly changing environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
