&lt;p&gt;Your primary responsibility will be supporting the client’s main day-to-day contact and playing a key role in building and growing relationships with clients through dependability, trustworthiness, and professionalism. You have a strong appetite for understanding your client’s business landscape, a keen grasp of what the agency has to offer, and the ambition to bridge those two seamlessly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will be managing, representing, and guiding the Agency’s solutions, coordinating and motivating all stakeholders—both internal (other departments within the agency) and external (clients, vendors, and partners).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage and communicate with clients to understand their business challenges, ambitions, project requirements, and any limitations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assemble and manage a team to best respond to client requests and address their business needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brief, communicate, and negotiate objectives, tasks, deliverables, and deadlines with both external and internal stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide teams to develop proposals, including marketing and communication strategies, creative concepts, budgets, and timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and manage internal and external meetings and presentations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Think strategically and act as a gatekeeper to ensure the work aligns with the client’s business objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the timely delivery of projects end-to-end, on budget, and meeting the quality excellence expected by both the Agency and the client&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and manage processes, roles, responsibilities, and tools between the Agency and clients to ensure effective and efficient workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage commercial activities, such as developing accurate quotes, documenting commercial communications (including sign-offs and closures), ensuring timely invoicing and payments, updating finance trackers/tools, and assisting in profitability analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and facilitate after-action reviews and analysis to drive continuous learning and improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate and manage bookings of team member’s time across various departments and offices per project staffing requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;(If applicable) Manage and grow internal teams, including Senior Account Executives, Account Executives, and Interns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 4 years of experience, with a focus on project delivery and client management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of digital, social media, and advertising jargon and technology, with a keen interest in emerging technologies and how they can address modern challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keen interest and understanding of brand strategy, communications and consumer behaviour and how these influence the Agency’s output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keen interest in results and campaign performance, and a hunger to find ways to optimize and improve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solutions-driven mindset and an open, innovative approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work under pressure and meet deadlines in a fast-paced, creative environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent time and resource management skills—highly organized with strong attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive in identifying opportunities, taking initiative, and seeing them through&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills, with the ability to effectively interact with colleagues at all levels and across various disciplines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional relationship management capabilities, especially within complex client organizations and structures&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, presentation, and mediation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving orientation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident in liaising with both internal and external stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Google Suite and presentation tools, with a willingness to learn new software/tools for day-to-day tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
