&lt;li&gt;10+ years’ experience in print/photo, motion, social and digital and post production / content production, with progressively expanding roles in an advertising agency or high-tech environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership, communication, and collaboration skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong PM Skill Set.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
