&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s expected&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced professional level. This is not an entry-level role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You follow the global conversation around AI aesthetics and visual innovation closely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You hold your own work to a high standard, every time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aftereffects/Nuke, Photoshop&amp;nbsp; or Equal. (This will give us the confidence that they can elevate the AI output in post)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3D software (Good to have, not mandatory)]&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Tools:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
