&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monks.slateapp.com/work/adforum-ask-maud-cannes-launch-film&quot;&gt;https://monks.slateapp.com/work/adforum-ask-maud-cannes-launch-film&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
