&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;As an &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Android Developer&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll be hands-on with production Jetpack Compose to help us build and maintain modern, scalable native Android apps for a large and well-known global retail brand that operates in dozens of markets. You’ll take ownership of UI and architecture, partner with other engineers to raise engineering quality, and ensure the app is fast, secure, and reliable in production. We are looking for someone who is passionate about seeking new opportunities to create impactful work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Own&lt;/strong&gt; Jetpack Compose development end-to-end: implement production UI, design system components, navigation patterns, and state management using best practices&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Build&lt;/strong&gt; with modern Android standards: scalable module structure, maintainable patterns, and architecture designed for long-term evolution—implemented in Kotlin&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Deliver&lt;/strong&gt; resilient production code, prioritizing performance tuning, responsive UI, secure networking, safe storage, and memory/thread safety&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Design&lt;/strong&gt; and implement core Android app layers using Retrofit/Ktor, Room, Dagger/Koin, Architecture Components, Coroutines, and reactive patterns&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Write&lt;/strong&gt; and maintain unit, integration, and UI tests to improve testability and participate in the overall test strategy&lt;/p&gt;
