&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Collaborate&lt;/strong&gt; daily using strong engineering practices including code reviews, technical discussions, and documentation across cross-functional teams, designers, QA, and project managers&lt;/p&gt;
