&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in art direction, visual design, or multidisciplinary creative roles within agencies, studios, or in-house creative organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong portfolio demonstrating exceptional craft across brand campaigns, digital experiences, social content, and integrated creative work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in Figma and a willingness to contribute directly to the work every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong foundation in typography, composition, layout, visual hierarchy, and digital design principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and executing creative work across digital, social, motion, and integrated campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motion design experience is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong creative judgment and an ability to refine work through thoughtful feedback and collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience adapting global creative for local audiences while maintaining brand consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills with the ability to work effectively across multidisciplinary teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with emerging AI creative tools (e.g. generative image, video, and language models) and an understanding of how to integrate them into the creative process to improve speed, exploration, and creative quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience and curiosity in using AI creative tools (e.g. generative image, video, and language models) to accelerate ideation, concept development, and creative production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
