&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Please note that we will never request payment or bank account information at any stage of the recruitment process. As we continue to grow our teams, we urge you to be cautious of fraudulent job postings or recruitment activities that misuse our company name and information. Please protect your personal information during any recruitment process. While Monks may contact potential candidates via LinkedIn, all applications must be submitted through our official website (&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;monks.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;As an Associate Creative Director, you’ll serve as a hybrid creative leader for an iconic global sports brand, acting as both a sharp conceptual thinker and an exceptional UI designer in one. You will move comfortably across the spectrum from immersive, idea-led campaigns to digital platforms and ecosystems where practical design thinking carries the weight. We are looking for someone who is passionate about seeking new opportunities to create impactful work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0&quot;&gt;Shape the creative vision for large-scale, long-term solutions, from immersive campaign sites to brand platforms, content ecosystems, products, and tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,1,0&quot;&gt;Design at the highest level by staying hands-on in Figma to shape screens, components, and systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,0&quot;&gt;Translate brand strategy and business objectives into functional user journeys, flows, states, and motion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,3,0&quot;&gt;Use AI fluently across the creative process for ideation, image creation, motion, voice, code, and prototyping.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,4,0&quot;&gt;Move from sketches to working prototypes quickly using Figma, code, AI tools, and rapid-build environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,5,0&quot;&gt;Look beyond the core product to fuse the full ecosystem of content, campaigns, and related technologies into a seamless brand experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,6,0&quot;&gt;Direct multidisciplinary teams across art direction, copy, and design while protecting the central idea from kickoff to launch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,7,0&quot;&gt;Mentor designers and creatives by providing the direction, feedback, and room they need to grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,8,0&quot;&gt;Build lasting relationships with the client, listening to their challenges and substantiating the work with both heart and proof.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;The essentials:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Around 7+ years for ACD, or 9+ years for CD, in digital design or creative leadership at a agency, studio, or in-house team. A portfolio showing both campaign-led concept work and platform-led web/product work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;UI Craft:&lt;/strong&gt; Mastery of digital design fundamentals (typography, grid, hierarchy, layout, color, motion) and fluency in Figma and modern design tooling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Platforms &amp;amp; Ecosystems:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience designing marketing sites, brand platforms, content ecosystems, configurators, products, and tools that have performed in-market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on practice with AI tooling across image, video, copy, code, and prototyping, with clear judgment on when to use it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Range &amp;amp; Curiosity:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to stretch from immersive campaigns to performance-led ecosystems, backed by a broad interest in culture, art, and internet trends.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Confidence:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to lead with clarity and care, mentor without ego, align teams, and comfortably present a vision to clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Sharp written and verbal communication skills with the ability to write clear design rationale and win the room.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,7,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,7,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Inclusivity &amp;amp; Dedication:&lt;/strong&gt; Respectful collaboration across disciplines, cultures, and time zones, with a balanced passion for the craft.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,8,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,8,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Passion:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong passion for sports and youth culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Not a must, but a plus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
