&lt;p&gt;Shanghai.monks, is looking for an art-based Associate Creative Director to create integrated creative campaign concepts. You understand Chinese youth audiences, digital and social trends, and inspire our clients with smart creativity. You thrive in a creative agency where you get your hands dirty and stretch far to make work that is remembered beyond today.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll spearhead the creation of breakthrough integrated concept decks spanning IMC, social, digital, film, and experiential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll take the lead on pitching and selling high-stakes campaign concepts to senior-level clients with confidence and clarity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll set the overarching visual direction for the brand, ensuring the team delivers &quot;pixel-perfect&quot; craft across every touchpoint.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;By leading from the front, you’ll infuse your team with creative ambition and actively foster top-tier talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll own the creative execution of projects, overseeing everything from the initial pitch through final production and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll partner with extraordinary copywriters, creative technologists, and producers across the global .Monks network to push the boundaries of what&#39;s possible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years in art-based and conceptual roles within top-tier creative agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 5 years of experience in Mainland China, paired with a deep understanding of the local social landscape and youth culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full professional fluency in both English and Mandarin Chinese is mandatory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a proven ability to manage, inspire, and grow diverse teams of creatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a genuine sports fan who is as skilled at elevated product storytelling as you are at driving social and community engagement around athletes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A body of work that demonstrates mastery across everything from high-end TVC and KV production to innovative social-first campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional presentation skills with a track record of winning pitches and building strong client relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
