&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Please note that we will never request payment or bank account information at any stage of the recruitment process. As we continue to grow our teams, we urge you to be cautious of fraudulent job postings or recruitment activities that misuse our company name and information. Please protect your personal information during any recruitment process. While Monks may contact potential candidates via LinkedIn, all applications must be submitted through our official website (&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;monks.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Associate Director of Influencer Marketing at Monks, you will lead the development and execution of integrated influencer marketing strategies for a diverse portfolio of global clients. As a strategic leader, you will be responsible for shaping overarching influencer programs that align with client business objectives, drive measurable growth, and strengthen long-term partnerships. Working closely with cross-functional teams—including Creative and&amp;nbsp; Strategy—you will ensure campaigns are executed seamlessly while delivering exceptional business results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond campaign leadership, you will play a critical role in growing the influencer marketing practice by identifying opportunities to expand existing client partnerships, developing innovative solutions, and supporting new business efforts through strategic proposals and client pitches. You will serve as a trusted advisor to senior client stakeholders, translating market trends, audience insights, and campaign performance into forward-looking strategies that position both clients and Monks for continued success. Your strategic mindset, commercial acumen, and leadership skills will be instrumental in driving client growth, fostering innovation, and elevating the agency&#39;s influencer marketing capabilities&lt;/p&gt;
