&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Director of Influencer Marketing to define long-term strategic roadmaps that drive measurable business impact across regional and global markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to grow existing client partnerships by expanding influencer marketing services, introducing innovative solutions, and developing integrated marketing strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support new business initiatives by contributing to pitches, developing strategic recommendations, and presenting influencer marketing solutions to prospective clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of industry trends, emerging platforms, creator economy developments, audience insights, and competitive activity to identify new opportunities for clients and the agency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
