&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Backend Developer&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll build, optimise, and maintain server-side Node.js and Python application logic. You will drive seamless integration and high performance in close collaboration with front-end developers, data analysts, and stakeholders to deliver scalable, robust backend solutions across diverse business applications. We are looking for someone who is passionate about seeking new opportunities to create impactful work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Build&lt;/strong&gt; and maintain high-performance, reliable server-side Node.js and Python logic&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Collaborate&lt;/strong&gt; with front-end developers to integrate user-facing elements with server-side logic&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Design&lt;/strong&gt; and implement APIs and RESTful services to industry standards&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Set up&lt;/strong&gt;, maintain, and optimize SQL (PostgreSQL, MySQL) and NoSQL (MongoDB, Redis) databases&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Optimize&lt;/strong&gt; application performance while ensuring long-term scalability and security&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Identify&lt;/strong&gt; and resolve bugs, performance bottlenecks, and infrastructure issues&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Write&lt;/strong&gt; clean, scalable code following Python and TypeScript best practices&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,7,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,7,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Participate&lt;/strong&gt; in code reviews and uphold coding standards and agile methodologies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,8,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,8,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Partner&lt;/strong&gt; with QA, DevOps, and Product Management to deliver robust production applications&lt;/p&gt;
