&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Business Director&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll oversee one of our largest portfolio brands, managing a mix of programme-based work across owned channels, social, strategy, and creative content production. In this lead client-facing position, you’ll work at the intersection of business and production to output high-fidelity strategy through to premium craft, combining platforms, creative content, data, and experience into one. We are looking for someone who is passionate about seeking new opportunities to create impactful work.&lt;/p&gt;
