&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with UX designers to align requirements with design direction, and collaborate with technical teams to agree on implementation approaches.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
