&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Story &amp;amp; Backlog Lifecycle:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead engineering teams through Epic kickoffs, drive story development, resolve scope unknowns, and facilitate the estimation process.&lt;/p&gt;
