&lt;li&gt;Problem-solving, attention to detail and organization skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Digital Agency production timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of the different departments, and associated roles and skill sets (motion, UX, strategy, QA, creative, development)&lt;/li&gt;
