&lt;p&gt;This role focuses on shaping digital marketing strategy and maturity focused on social, communicating the value of the deployed solutions and nurturing client relationships. While it requires technical knowledge in media and data, you will be supported by our technical teams (media SMEs, analysts, platform experts, engineers and data scientists) when it comes to execution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be someone with proven project management experience, who has worked across media and analytics-related projects with proven results. You will deliver value through orchestrating and communicating the value of media strategies at scale and deliver through tailored analytics, media and cloud solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
