&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with clients to understand their business objectives and data maturity to develop KPIs and roadmaps that drive desired outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of comprehensive project plans that detail the roles, responsibilities, and deliverables for each team and stakeholder.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organise and support project teams to deliver high-quality output across defined scopes of work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a team of 4-5 paid media service professionals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that business outcomes are clearly defined, approved and delivered with benefits realised and value clearly communicated at each step of the way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop quality content to communicate project plans, wins and issues to internal and external leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organise day-to-day, weekly and ongoing communication with internal and external stakeholders through project plans, emails, meetings and QBRs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage relationships with internal and external stakeholders on the project that support effective execution and efficient delivery&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage internal operations for the project including but not limited to time tracking, ticketing, billing, and finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop processes and documentation to organise day-to-day project operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead communications and nurture client relationships that encourage growth opportunities beyond the project scope&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the building of knowledge and capability amongst the client service organisation through facilitating training and mentoring of team members&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively drive the identification and execution of growth opportunities across accounts to increase revenue opportunities and profitability of engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
