&lt;li&gt;Specific expertise in Social media platforms is required for this role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AdTech or MarTech solutions (such as Google Marketing Platform, Amazon, Google Ads, Meta, TikTok etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grasp of the overall digital consultancy space, including but not limited to knowledge of Monks competitive set and their offerings across data and digital media.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;People management experience &amp;amp; ability and desire to scale knowledge and facilitate learning among team members&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project management experience, with demonstrated abilities to manage and organise projects, build detailed project plans, and manage multiple internal and external stakeholders to deliver outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, both written and verbal, and ability to effectively communicate with stakeholders ranging from C-suite through to platform SMEs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Optional Requirements:&lt;/p&gt;
