&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Please note that we will never request payment or bank account information at any stage of the recruitment process. As we continue to grow our teams, we urge you to be cautious of fraudulent job postings or recruitment activities that misuse our company name and information. Please protect your personal information during any recruitment process. While Monks may contact potential candidates via LinkedIn, all applications must be submitted through our official website (&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;monks.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;As a Creative Director, you’ll set the creative vision for our Cairo studio, spearhead client relationships across the Gulf, and inspire a multidisciplinary team of creative professionals to produce award-worthy, integrated work for a global digital marketing powerhouse. We are looking for someone who is passionate about seeking new opportunities to create impactful work, blending culture, creativity, and technology to help ambitious brands tell great stories and grow across the Middle East and Africa (MEA) region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Define&lt;/strong&gt; and champion the overall creative vision, strategic direction, and quality bar for the Cairo studio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Lead&lt;/strong&gt; the ideation, development, and execution of integrated creative campaigns across brand, digital, social, and production disciplines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Manage&lt;/strong&gt;, mentor, and inspire a team of 20+ creatives, including art directors, copywriters, designers, and content specialists.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Foster&lt;/strong&gt; a collaborative, high-performance studio culture that balances ambition with operational rigour.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Build&lt;/strong&gt; and nurture strong, trust-based relationships with senior clients across the Gulf region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Spearhead&lt;/strong&gt; and win new creative pitches, from initial strategic framing and creative concepting through to final presentation delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
