&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,8,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,8,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Champion&lt;/strong&gt; the integration of new technologies, including AI-powered creative tools, into the studio&#39;s workflow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,9,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,9,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Stay&lt;/strong&gt; ahead of cultural trends, platform innovations, and consumer behaviours relevant to MEA audiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,10,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,10,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Lead&lt;/strong&gt; talent recruitment, onboarding, and professional development within the creative department.&lt;/p&gt;
