&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll provide support for established projects and also contribute graphic solutions and proposals from scratch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll collaborate with Project Managers and Producers to drive clarity, consistency and quality through all stages of the production process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll work as part of a global team of designers, illustrators, animators and art directors that produces world-class work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The job is about harmonising style, craft intelligence, speed and scale to meet the evolving needs of brands for innovative and eye-catching content.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pixel perfection and error-free ad content are important. You safeguard quality at all times and work together with visual QAs in order to achieve that.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Requirement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
