&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Designer, you will develop innovative digital ads and assets for one of the world&#39;s largest packaged goods companies. This role demands expertise in balancing speed, style, and scale to produce high-quality visual content that resonates across multiple platforms. We are looking for someone passionate about seeking new opportunities, contributing to a nimble, AI-forward team, and creating impactful work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create style proposals, concept mockups, and prototypes to initiate design projects for products, features, and campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to ensure designs meet client expectations and brand guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Studying and applying brand guidelines to designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute the art direction while providing innovative ideas, inspiration, and best practices to enhance the creative process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate creative briefs into thorough design briefs that inform the design process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure pixel-perfect execution of designs, safeguarding quality at all times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Specialise in crafting interactive assets for social media and other digital channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be capable of creating designs and technical setup for typical POS print media.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand cultural trends and create designs that demonstrate relevance and appeal on social platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate storytelling through design, combining aesthetics and functionality in motion graphics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideate and assist in creating style proposals to win pitches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the production team in quality assurance during project rollouts across various markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
