&lt;li&gt;3-5 years of experience as a Designer specialising in crafting digital designs and advertising materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Figma and also Adobe Creative Suite, particularly Photoshop, Illustrator, and InDesign. After Effects is a bonus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong portfolio showcasing expertise in digital design and advertising materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with all stages of the design process, from conceptualisation to final layout execution and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of design fundamentals such as typography, grid systems, interaction design, flow, and storytelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills for effective collaboration with team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to present designs confidently to colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fast and flexible mindset, ready to jump on new opportunities and adapt to changing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of social media dynamics and how to create engaging content for different platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in current design trends and cultural relevance to inform creative decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
