&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a high-ownership, delivery-focused Digital Project Manager to join our team on a Full-Time basis. This role is designed to lead the execution of complex, large-scale projects and intertwined scopes of work for our major enterprise clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will completely own the delivery ecosystem across your assigned portfolio. You will focus strictly on agile execution, resource tracking, and project-level financials, collaborating seamlessly with our Client Partnership and Strategy/Technical Lead teams to ensure successful, high-quality project delivery and account stability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Delivery &amp;amp; Agile Governance&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scope Ownership: Take complete ownership of large, intertwined, and complex scopes of work across enterprise client portfolios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile Management: Actively manage Jira sprints, backlogs, prioritization, and project documentation. Ensure tasks are properly scoped and executed to hit delivery milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Client Representation: Attend client stand-ups and sprint planning sessions to represent progress, proactively address issues, and remove delivery blockers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resource Management &amp;amp; Capacity Planning&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivery Planning: Design, implement, and maintain delivery and resourcing plans outlining the specific headcount needed for project tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacity Control: Manage day-to-day task allocation and capacity management across the delivery teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run-Rate &amp;amp; Pacing: Closely track ongoing run-rates and identify resourcing needs or gaps early. Proactively flag to Technical Leads and Client Partners if the delivery pace is falling behind internal revenue forecasts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Control &amp;amp; Financial Operations&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scope &amp;amp; Margin Control: Manage day-to-day project financials to tightly control margins and fiercely eliminate scope creep.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial Tracking: Serve as the primary operational owner for ongoing financial cycles, ensuring project metrics directly feed into company revenue recognition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Administrative Operations: Own and execute End of Month (EOM) processing, invoicing operations, and CRM/Salesforce pipeline hygiene.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years in a project or program manager role leading operations and owning large-scale, intertwined project portfolios for major enterprise clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mastery of agile methodologies, Jira sprint management, backlog grooming, and running efficient client sprint ceremonies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High financial discipline with direct experience tracking project run-rates, tightly controlling budgets, preventing scope creep, and running End of Month (EOM) processing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to design delivery plans, manage day-to-day capacity across cross-functional teams, and flag resource gaps early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communicator who can align technical delivery teams with client expectations and confidently present progress, blockers, and timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-ownership operator comfortable in a fast-paced environment. Adept at navigating a clear RACI structure alongside Technical Leads and Client Partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level proficiency utilizing enterprise project tracking and CRM ecosystems (specifically Jira and Salesforce).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with MarTech or data platforms (Adobe Experience Platform, Salesforce Marketing Cloud, Braze, or similar) is highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to cloud environments (GCP, AWS) or data engineering / analytics engineering concepts preferred.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Google Analytics, Adobe Analytics, or Google Cloud certification experience would be an added plus!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
