&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;.Monks Technology Services, part of Media.Monks and S4 Capital, is a global consulting firm mastering AI-powered transformations for the Fortune 100. We combine long-term strategic thinking, deep enterprise experience, and a human-centered approach to help clients transform business processes and dominate their industries.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;As part of our commitment to inclusion and in compliance with Law 2466 of 2025 from Colombia, we have available spaces for people with disabilities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Bogotá, Colombia&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Are you a finance professional who thrives at the intersection of strategy, data, and real-time business impact? We are looking for a Commercial FP&amp;amp;A Analyst to join our team. In this role, you won&#39;t just be crunching numbers in a silo—you will be the financial co-pilot to our Commercial and Client Management teams. You will directly influence pricing strategies, evaluate new deals under IFRS standards, and unlock insights that drive revenue and gross margin expansion across our multinational footprint.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;As part of our commitment to diversity and in compliance with the &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;66&quot;&gt;Inclusion Law 2466 of 2025&lt;/strong&gt;, .Monks actively opens quotas and tailored onboarding processes for professionals with disabilities. If you require any reasonable accommodations during the recruitment process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
