&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Business Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the primary financial advisor to the Sales and Client Management teams, influencing pricing structures, commercial proposals, and investment decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
