&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Deal Structuring:&lt;/strong&gt; From Pricing to Execution. Join the Deal’s journey and partner with the business across the whole process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
