&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; Draft IFRS accounting memos for new and complex deals, ensuring revenue recognition aligns with global standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Advanced Analytics:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead deep-dive revenue reviews and gross margin analyses to identify growth opportunities, leakages, and profitability drivers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
