&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strategic Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Sales, Marketing Operations, and Executive Leadership to build models that drive long-term strategic success and profitability.&lt;/p&gt;
