&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Analytical Thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; Expertise in executing deep-dive revenue reviews and extracting actionable insights from complex data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strategic Modeling:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency in translating intricate business logic into clean, dynamic financial models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional skills to partner as a co-pilot with non-finance stakeholders and executive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
