&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;14,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 3+ years of experience in FP&amp;amp;A, Corporate Finance, or Commercial Finance. Tech or Multinational company experience is a huge plus.&lt;/p&gt;
