&lt;li&gt;You’ll help to shape the way forward for motion graphics within the team inspiring and collaborating with the AV team to produce top class content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll help the team in the conception of creative audiovisual ideas based on the objectives to be communicated and actively participate in the development of audiovisual content and post-production content which is fit for feed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll produce high-quality deliverables such as effects, motion graphic guidelines and innovative new techniques that can be used across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a passion for taking the ordinary and making it extraordinary through movement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You make sure all designs are in line with the project’s objectives and client expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
