&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience working as a multimedia designer at a high, international level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You´re fluent in both English &amp;amp; Arabic (written and spoken).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have an advanced level of understanding related to motion graphic design and video editing. Basic shooting level hardware and software.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience on color correction and knowledge on audio editing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2D and 3D animation is advantageous but not mandatory,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are entrepreneurial in nature and will find a way to create content which exceeds any limitations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In our line of business, there’s a little surprise around every corner, but with your creative problem-solving skills you can tackle each and everyone of them.&lt;/li&gt;
