&lt;p&gt;Leading multidisciplinary creative teams, this position establishes the visual standards, operating frameworks, and creative systems that enable exceptional work at scale. Partnering cross-functionally with Strategy, Governance, Operations, AI Solutions, Production, and Localization teams, you will drive best-in-class creative outcomes across human and agentic production models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Lowdown&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and mentor multidisciplinary creative teams across different regions, fostering a culture of creative excellence, innovation, and continuous learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the craft quality and visual integrity of all outputs across campaigns, adaptive content, and AI-enabled asset production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate strategic objectives into scalable design systems, executional frameworks, and production methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and evolve creative standards, governance models, and approval processes that ensure consistency across brands, markets, and channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to optimize workflows across agentic and hybrid production environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the development and implementation of templates, component libraries, style guides, toolkits, and creative playbooks that support scalable content creation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the adoption of AI-enabled creative workflows while maintaining rigorous standards for craft, brand integrity, accessibility, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate emerging technologies and identify opportunities to improve creative effectiveness, production efficiency, and organizational capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion best practices in design, motion, storytelling, accessibility, and visual communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage creative resourcing, team development, performance feedback, and capability building across the creative organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the escalation point for creative quality, executional challenges, and workflow optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead local Art Directors to enforce craft quality supervision and foster improvement in asset output quiality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scope&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reports to senior creative leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads multidisciplinary regional creative production teams within an AI-first, agentic production environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owns creative craft, executional quality, design systems, and production readiness across multiple brands and channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influences organization-wide standards, tooling decisions, workflows, and capability development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborates cross-functionally with Strategy, Governance, Operations, AI Solutions, Production, Account, and Localization teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balances creative ambition with scalability, speed, efficiency, and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
