&lt;li&gt;Exceptional visual craft across typography, composition, motion, design systems, and digital experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in Figma and modern design system methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of AI-enabled creative workflows, automation, and agentic production models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience translating creative ideas into scalable production frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong operational mindset with experience balancing creative quality, timelines, budgets, and resource allocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating assets for eCommerce channels is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills with the ability to influence senior leaders and cross-functional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing governance frameworks, quality assurance processes, and creative standards at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for coaching and developing creative talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Success in This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
