&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agent/Agentic Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Spin up, configure, and maintain new AI agents and Agentic flows within existing tools and environments using existing Google frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Feature Translation:&lt;/strong&gt; Collect and synthesize user and BU feedback into structured feature requests for the Core Engineering team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Documentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain clear documentation on implementations, configurations, and workflows for cross-team transparency.&lt;/li&gt;
