&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;As a Dutch Backend Developer, you’ll build, optimise, and maintain server-side Java application logic for our clients, driving seamless integration and high performance. Working closely with front-end developers, data analysts, and key stakeholders, you will deliver scalable, robust backend solutions across diverse business applications. We are looking for someone who is passionate about seeking new opportunities to create impactful work.&lt;/p&gt;
