&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Set up&lt;/strong&gt;, maintain, and optimize databases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Optimise&lt;/strong&gt; application performance and ensure scalability and security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Identify&lt;/strong&gt; and resolve bugs and performance bottlenecks.&lt;/p&gt;
