&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Write&lt;/strong&gt; clean, scalable code following Java best practices.&lt;/p&gt;
