&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;About You&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;The essentials:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Citizenship &amp;amp; Language:&lt;/strong&gt; Dutch citizenship and fluency in the Dutch language are required.&lt;/p&gt;
