&lt;li&gt;Portfolio or work samples required (internship, freelance, or agency work welcome)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills and attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with short-form content and social media platforms&lt;/li&gt;
