&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Please note that we will never request payment or bank account information at any stage of the recruitment process. As we continue to grow our teams, we urge you to be cautious of fraudulent job postings or recruitment activities that misuse our company name and information. Please protect your personal information during any recruitment process. While Monks may contact potential candidates via LinkedIn, all applications must be submitted through our official website (&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;monks.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks is looking for an experienced Marketing Data Specialist with enterprise-level client facing experience in analytics consulting and the deployment of marketing and e-commerce projects. This experience should specifically include helping clients to develop data strategies, complex measurement projects, and experience driving value with expert knowledge and client relationship skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for data &amp;amp; analytics initiatives relevant to marketing and audience data consulting, which includes managing relationships with a number of enterprise clients, building out their analytics frameworks, deployment of the required tools, developing insights through reporting and and understanding of needs-based recommendations and optimisations in both technology and data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate has a history of working with Google Data Products (GTM, GA4 and BigQuery), Adobe Experience Cloud (Analytics, Launch, AEP) or Amplitude to help a variety of businesses, overseeing or directly having a hand in the implementation of their data collection, as well as finding ways to utilise this data to drive value for their clients through reporting and analysis. An understanding of the CRM &amp;amp; CDP landscape is a welcome addition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role&amp;nbsp; offers a huge opportunity for growth within our AUNZ team and APAC data team with clear channels of progression into leadership, the ability to participate in innovation on projects and product development, and the potential to advance the practice of analytics and data from the forefront.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities Will Include&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide subject matter expertise in Data Analytics Platforms and Data Collection to your clients via overseeing the tagging and analytics framework, and a variety of analysis and insight initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop analytics and data strategies for some of the largest brands in the world with a focus on measurably lifting their business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share your data and marketing analytics expertise with your clients and the Monks team; acting as a thought leader for your client through consultative discovery and recommendations, and be an active participant in the knowledge growth of the Monks team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the relationship and projects for enterprise clients from a delivery perspective&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist clients in understanding the importance of measurement, and provide best practice guidelines for their general data strategy, as well as specific technical implementations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist the data team in propelling our practice forward with new go to market initiatives and solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Client Onboarding: Perform digital audits for prospective clients and existing clients, recording findings and making recommendations across digital properties and data reporting environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Management &amp;amp; Reporting: Manage Data Reporting Platforms (Analytics) and Aggregation tools (e.g. BigQuery)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conceptualising and&amp;nbsp; building&amp;nbsp; POC-level AI based tools: Analysis &amp;amp; Insights, Conversational &amp;amp; NLP, MCPs and the ability to connect these as agents. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have deep knowledge and experience using mainstream Digital Analytics platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a deep knowledge and understanding of the current state of the data, adtech, and martech industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience managing strategic projects and/or clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are self-directed, resourceful, and a critical thinker with attention-to-detail and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are someone who loves to collaborate within cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience implementing, and utilizing the data from a variety of digital analytics tools and cloud platforms;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with BI/Data analysis tools (Looker Studio, Tableau, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with cloud data (GCP / BigQuery, AWS, Snowflake, etc.) and how to leverage it in conjunction with marketing analytics data is a big plus in consideration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-LL1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Monks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks is the global, digital-first, data-driven, unitary operating brand of S4 Capital plc. With a legacy of innovation and specialized expertise, Monks combines an extraordinary range of global Marketing and Technology Services to redefine how brands interact with the world. Through Monks.Flow, its flagship AI ecosystem for marketing orchestration, Monks transforms marketing into a growth engine, collapsing timelines and connecting brands to culture in real time. By deploying bespoke intelligent agents across disciplines and delivering culturally relevant, high-impact creative and digital solutions, Monks solves key critical business challenges across the entire brand enterprise to help brands sustain long-term impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks was named a Contender in The Forrester Wave™: Global Marketing Services, ranks among Cannes Lions&#39; Top 10 Creative Companies (2022-25) and remains the only partner featured in AdExchanger’s Programmatic Power Players list every year (2020-24). Named Adweek’s first AI Agency of the Year (2023) and The One Show’s inaugural AI Pioneer Organization, Monks was also awarded Business Intelligence Group’s 2025 Excellence in Artificial Intelligence Award in both the Organizational and AI Product categories. As a trusted partner to cutting-edge innovators in tech, Monks earned titles such as Optimizely Experimentation Partner of the Year (2025), runner-up for the Adobe Firefly Partner Award (2024), and Workato’s AI Visionary Customer Impact Award (2024). Additionally, Monks achieved a record-breaking number of FWAs and continues to hold the most of any partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to building a respectful and empowering work environment for all people to freely express themselves amongst colleagues who embrace diversity in all respects. Including fresh voices and unique points of view in all aspects of our business not only creates an environment where we can all grow and thrive but also increases our potential to produce work that better represents—and resonates with—the world around us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Please note that we will never request payment or bank account information at any stage of the recruitment process. As we continue to grow our teams, we urge you to be cautious of fraudulent job postings or recruitment activities that misuse our company name and information. Please protect your personal information during any recruitment process. While Monks may contact potential candidates via LinkedIn, all applications must be submitted through our official website (&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;monks.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Como Analista de Mídia, você será a força motriz por trás das nossas operações, transformando estratégia em realidade nas plataformas digitais. Seu papel é crucial para garantir a execução perfeita das campanhas, conectando dados a ações práticas para impulsionar resultados significativos para nossos clientes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsabilidades&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gerenciar o ciclo de vida completo das campanhas nas principais plataformas de mídia (Google, Meta, TikTok, etc.), desde a configuração até a otimização diária.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implementar as melhores práticas de mercado em segmentações, estratégias de lances, formatos de criativos e configurações de conversão.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Garantir a execução precisa do planejamento tático, gerenciando o ritmo de investimento para maximizar os resultados dentro do orçamento.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Propor e executar testes A/B e experimentos com base em hipóteses claras para melhorar continuamente a performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitorar e analisar os KPIs de campanha diariamente, traduzindo dados em insights acionáveis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desenvolver relatórios de performance claros para comunicação interna e, quando necessário, para o cliente.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fornecer suporte técnico inicial para dúvidas de clientes, resolvendo problemas básicos de plataforma.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manter a liderança do time informada sobre o progresso das campanhas e ações de otimização realizadas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Habilidades Essenciais&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proficiência Técnica:&lt;/strong&gt; Capacidade de aprender e operar com precisão nas principais plataformas de mídia digital, aplicando as melhores práticas de configuração.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raciocínio Analítico:&lt;/strong&gt; Habilidade de analisar dados de campanhas para identificar tendências, extrair aprendizados e basear otimizações em evidências.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curiosidade e Proatividade:&lt;/strong&gt; Vontade de aprender, buscar conhecimento de forma autônoma e sugerir melhorias com base em observações.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organização e Gestão de Tempo:&lt;/strong&gt; Capacidade de gerenciar múltiplas tarefas e cumprir prazos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comunicação Colaborativa:&lt;/strong&gt; Habilidade de se comunicar de forma clara e objetiva com a equipe interna, compartilhando status e aprendizados.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Monks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
