&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute creative and engaging social media strategies in collaboration with strategy and creative teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the day-to-day handling of social media content across channels including Facebook, Twitter, Instagram, and YouTube, adapting content to suit different channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spot social opportunities within wider creative ideas. Mainly focusing on Instagram and Tik Tok.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a monthly social editorial calendar and align with the wider content team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create content in-the-moment in response to social trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure legal compliance of content (e.g. copyright and data protection).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop innovative creative in response to client briefs, alongside identifying proactive opportunities to develop social content that will fulfill the brand objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present ideas comprehensively to clients and colleagues, confidently explaining and supporting your thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amend and redevelop content in response to feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand performance metrics, and use them to inform future creative development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be responsible for the full creative funnel, from ideation to creation of social content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand social platforms and trends in real time to trigger new ideas and proposals for campaigns.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience you already have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A social native, active across a multitude of platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate passion for socially-led creative thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of proven work experience as a social-first creative for an agency / brand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of developing exciting social executions for brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A keen eye on emerging social trends across platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of crafting reactive content in response to social trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on brave, innovative brands, looking to push cultural boundaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The individual must be at ease recording content and &lt;strong&gt;appearing on-camera&lt;/strong&gt;, with the capability to manage the end-to-end production process, including copywriting and creative development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A keen eye for visual details and accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deep understanding of consumer behaviour, and adapting content plans to address the needs of the community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Video editing is a &#39;must. &lt;/strong&gt;We are looking for an independent creator capable of managing projects from &lt;strong&gt;concept to completion&lt;/strong&gt;, including basic editing of their own content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A great team player.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;ideal &lt;/strong&gt;candidate should be well-versed in the &lt;strong&gt;User-Generated Content (UGC)&lt;/strong&gt; landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
