&lt;p&gt;In this role, your primary mission is to act as the architect of our visual output. You won’t just be creating videos; you will be building the engines that allow our global campaigns to live across dozens of languages and formats with surgical precision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are the bridge between high-end design and massive-scale execution. While you will develop original creative assets, your core focus is on the technical craft of &lt;strong&gt;localization, template architecture, and AI-driven automation&lt;/strong&gt; using the Google ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Master Template Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and &quot;bulletproof&quot; complex After Effects templates. You will ensure that layouts, typography, and timings adapt intelligently to varying text lengths and localized content via Expressions and Essential Graphics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Precision Localization:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the end-to-end technical rollout of global campaigns. You will ensure every regional variation is frame-perfect, managing the nuances of different languages and cultural formats with an obsessive eye for detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workflow Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Champion the use of AI-assisted tools to eliminate manual tasks. You will connect data feeds (Sheets/CSV) to creative templates to trigger high-volume renders with minimal manual intervention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Asset Scaling &amp;amp; QA:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain rigorous organizational standards across massive asset libraries. You are the final line of defense, ensuring that every export—regardless of the quantity—meets our exact technical and brand specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Creative Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Design the foundational &quot;Hero&quot; motion assets that serve as the blueprint for our automated systems, ensuring they are built from the ground up for scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Technical Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Architect:&lt;/strong&gt; You believe a project is only as good as its structure. You prioritize clean hierarchies, strict naming conventions, and scalable workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Logic Specialist:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a deep command of &lt;strong&gt;After Effects Expressions&lt;/strong&gt; and scripting, using them to solve layout challenges before they occur.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Google Power-User:&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable navigating &lt;strong&gt;Google Workspace, &lt;/strong&gt;and leveraging &lt;strong&gt;Gemini/AI tools&lt;/strong&gt; to optimize creative production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Detail Obsessed:&lt;/strong&gt; You are someone who naturally spots a 1-pixel misalignment or a slight tracking inconsistency across 100+ localized banners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
