&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Video Editor, you’ll transform footage into engaging and polished stories that capture attention and move audiences. You’ll play a vital role in a fast-paced creative team with a high end technical focus, working on distinctive brand campaigns and collaborating with visionary producers and creative leaders. Whether fine-tuning short-form social content, dynamic digital ads, or cinematic brand films, you’ll be instrumental in shaping compelling narratives for internationally recognized brands. We are looking for someone who is passionate about seeking new opportunities to create impactful work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Edit and assemble footage into polished final products suitable for customer objectives and platform requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Craft beautiful motion graphics assets for all types of platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with producers, designers, and creative teams to understand project vision, narrative structure, and key messaging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee and mentor junior editors to help them learn and improve their craft&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhance videos with graphics, sound, music, and effects in line with brand and campaign guidelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organize and manage media assets, project files, and version control for efficient workflow and collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all videos meet technical specifications and quality standards, performing color correction and audio balancing as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support multiple projects simultaneously while meeting tight deadlines and adapting quickly to shifting priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incorporate feedback from creative direction and customers, iterating on edits as required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current on industry trends, editing techniques, and new software/tools to continually elevate the standard of our video output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
