&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The essentials:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years’ experience in video editing, preferably within a creative agency or production studio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Adobe Premiere Pro, After Effects, and other industry-standard post production tools like Da Vinci Resolve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of Photoshop, Illustrator and Figma to be able to extract graphics and import them into your post production softwares.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong storytelling instincts with a keen eye for pacing, continuity, and visual impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional organizational skills and attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to manage multiple projects and thrive in a deadline-driven environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative problem solving skills and a good tolerance for uncertainty&lt;/li&gt;
