&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; You will act as a flexible team player, actively communicating your progress, problems, and pitfalls while collaborating seamlessly with both juniors and seniors alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
