&lt;li&gt;Lead hiring and onboarding of new team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own overall team performance and represent the regional finance operation&lt;/strong&gt; to internal stakeholders and financial controllership teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with suppliers and internal stakeholders &lt;/strong&gt;to help ensure invoices are processed and paid on time.&lt;/li&gt;
