&lt;li&gt;Degree in Accounting, Finance or a similar related field is required. Additional professional qualifications in a related field desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 10 years of Accounts Payable experience, specifically within a multi-entity environment with at least 2+ years in a lead position,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing in people management including training, development and performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with NetSuite OneWorld is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience in Advanced Excel (Pivot Tables, VLOOKUPs) required.&lt;/li&gt;
