&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Please note that we will never request payment or bank account information at any stage of the recruitment process. As we continue to grow our teams, we urge you to be cautious of fraudulent job postings or recruitment activities that misuse our company name and information. Please protect your personal information during any recruitment process. While Monks may contact potential candidates via LinkedIn, all applications must be submitted through our official website (&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;monks.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Paid Media &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyst&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be the technical engine behind our digital campaign execution. You will support media strategy leads by translating client briefs into actionable digital plans, with a &lt;strong&gt;mandatory requirement for hands-on implementation&lt;/strong&gt; within &lt;strong&gt;Google Ads&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Meta Business Suite&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role requires a high level of technical organization and a passion for the &quot;why&quot; behind the numbers. You will ensure that every digital touchpoint—from naming conventions to budget pacing—is executed with precision. You will act as a collaborative bridge between strategy and production to ensure our digital presence is seamless and optimized.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Campaign Implementation &amp;amp; Activation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meta Ads Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Direct, hands-on setup of campaigns within Meta Ads Manager, including audience building (Lookalike/Custom), creative testing, and technical troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Google Ads Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Implementation and daily management of Search, Display, and Video (YouTube) campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Taxonomy &amp;amp; Tracking:&lt;/strong&gt; Responsible for building rigorous naming conventions and UTM structures to ensure clean data across all platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital Quality Control:&lt;/strong&gt; Review all digital assets (specs, formats, copies) to ensure they meet the specific technical requirements of Google and Meta before launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Asset Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Coordinate with production teams to ensure all creative materials are received and formatted correctly for digital delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Planning &amp;amp; Tactical Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital Strategy Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Participate in developing digital tactical plans, using tools like Google Keyword Planner and Meta Audience Insights for simulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Estimation:&lt;/strong&gt; Assist in projecting digital KPIs (CTR, CPC, CPA) based on historical platform data and current market benchmarks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benchmarking:&lt;/strong&gt; Assist in research and general benchmarking of digital trends to support new campaign ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Optimization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Extraction:&lt;/strong&gt; Perform daily data extraction directly from Meta Business Suite and Google Ads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor live campaigns and proactively recommend bidding adjustments, creative swaps, or audience pivots to improve results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insight Organization:&lt;/strong&gt; Help &quot;tell the story&quot; of the data by organizing platform results into clear, actionable client-facing slides.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 1-2 years of experience in digital media.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Technical Requirement:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven &lt;strong&gt;hands-on experience&lt;/strong&gt; setting up and managing campaigns within &lt;strong&gt;Meta Ads Manager&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Google Ads&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Detail-Oriented:&lt;/strong&gt; High attention to detail regarding tracking codes, platform-specific specs, and budget pacing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactive Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to identify potential campaign issues before they arise and suggest technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred (Nice to Have)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AdTech:&lt;/strong&gt; Knowledge or exposure to &lt;strong&gt;Campaign Manager 360 (CM)&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Display &amp;amp; Video 360 (DV360)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytics:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;Google Analytics 4 (GA4)&lt;/strong&gt; for post-click behavior analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Certifications:&lt;/strong&gt; Active Google Ads (Search/Video) or Meta Blueprint certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Monks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks is the global, digital-first, data-driven, unitary operating brand of S4 Capital plc. With a legacy of innovation and specialized expertise, Monks combines an extraordinary range of global Marketing and Technology Services to redefine how brands interact with the world. Through Monks.Flow, its flagship AI ecosystem for marketing orchestration, Monks transforms marketing into a growth engine, collapsing timelines and connecting brands to culture in real time. By deploying bespoke intelligent agents across disciplines and delivering culturally relevant, high-impact creative and digital solutions, Monks solves key critical business challenges across the entire brand enterprise to help brands sustain long-term impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks was named a Contender in The Forrester Wave™: Global Marketing Services, ranks among Cannes Lions&#39; Top 10 Creative Companies (2022-25) and remains the only partner featured in AdExchanger’s Programmatic Power Players list every year (2020-24). Named Adweek’s first AI Agency of the Year (2023) and The One Show’s inaugural AI Pioneer Organization, Monks was also awarded Business Intelligence Group’s 2025 Excellence in Artificial Intelligence Award in both the Organizational and AI Product categories. As a trusted partner to cutting-edge innovators in tech, Monks earned titles such as Optimizely Experimentation Partner of the Year (2025), runner-up for the Adobe Firefly Partner Award (2024), and Workato’s AI Visionary Customer Impact Award (2024). Additionally, Monks achieved a record-breaking number of FWAs and continues to hold the most of any partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to building a respectful and empowering work environment for all people to freely express themselves amongst colleagues who embrace diversity in all respects. Including fresh voices and unique points of view in all aspects of our business not only creates an environment where we can all grow and thrive but also increases our potential to produce work that better represents—and resonates with—the world around us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Please note that we will never request payment or bank account information at any stage of the recruitment process. As we continue to grow our teams, we urge you to be cautious of fraudulent job postings or recruitment activities that misuse our company name and information. Please protect your personal information during any recruitment process. While Monks may contact potential candidates via LinkedIn, all applications must be submitted through our official website (&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;monks.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Paid Media Specialist&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Specialist &lt;/strong&gt;you can expect to support, manage, optimize and report on media campaigns for a portfolio of clients as part of a broader team. Successful team members in this role will demonstrate the ability to support ongoing media efforts for clients in strong collaboration with other team members. You’ll be responsible for hands-on-keyboard activation of digital channels - inclusive of tagging, trafficking, buying, etc. - and how to use the right digital platforms - and use them well - to achieve media and business goals. We ensure consistency, governance, and support around platform usage and activation activities and aid in all ongoing building, buying, optimization, and reporting efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role you will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively partner with team members upon request to complete tasks (internal and external)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in campaign builds in accordance with best practices and client needs: set budgets and pacing, assign creatives to appropriate line items, assign campaign/IO/line item-level targeting (mid-/low-level object targeting), advertiser setup and linkage, tagging across in-scope platforms, channel overlap and interplay.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide updates to clients, troubleshoot basic issues on in-scope platforms: troubleshoot campaign issues, provide platform updates, offer recommendations based on best practices, follows escalation path &amp;amp; escalates issues accordingly, use various internal &amp;amp; external resources, appropriately communicate cause/effect and next steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure QA across your own book of business, e.g…&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain understanding of MM &amp;amp; team QA processes &amp;amp; tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain QA best practices with lessons-learned from own and other team’s QA experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with team members to complete QA checks across your team’s accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and grow relationships with internal stakeholders in order to ascertain business needs and craft the best strategic and tactical approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and communicate growth opportunities for current clients to management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep the pulse of the market and roll out processes &amp;amp; products as we scale that would add value to our growing client base and our rapidly expanding organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience you already have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enthusiasm for the digital media industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 1 year of hands-on experience managing Google Ads, Social platforms, and Programmatic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Google Sheets or Excel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data analysis abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consultative approach when developing and managing business relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovative thinker who brings ideas and strategies to life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, versatile and driven to obtain new skills and scale knowledge to take on uncharted territory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working among intercultural teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced english both written and spoken. This item will be tested during the interview process.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
