&lt;li&gt;Develop and grow relationships with client-side stakeholders (partners at Google, Meta and other key Media players) in order to ascertain business needs and craft the best strategic and tactical approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise clients on industry trends, the competitive landscape, and how this impacts them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align client&#39;s needs with our solutions and processes to create an efficient way of working to help them achieve their goals and uncover opportunities to drive long-term value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep the pulse of the market and roll out processes &amp;amp; products as we scale that would add value to our growing client base and our rapidly expanding organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience you already have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2-4&lt;/strong&gt; years experience &lt;strong&gt;implementing Paid Media campaigns&lt;/strong&gt; in a technology company or end-advertiser.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;Social&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;platforms&lt;/strong&gt; (Ex: Meta, Twitter, LinkedIn, Tik Tok, Snapchat, or others)&amp;nbsp; is a must.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with &lt;strong&gt;Programmatic&lt;/strong&gt; (Ex: DV360, CM and/or The Trade Desk) or &lt;strong&gt;Search &lt;/strong&gt;(Ex: Google Ads, SA360, Amazon) &lt;strong&gt;is desired, but not required.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data analysis abilities, Google Analytics &amp;amp; Data Studio experience is desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent consultative approach when developing and managing business relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovative thinker who brings ideas and strategies to life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, versatile and driven to obtain new skills and scale knowledge to take on uncharted territory.&lt;/li&gt;
