&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role &amp;amp; Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll easily master and apply general design knowledge such as alignments, compositions, and typographic handling. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll provide support for established projects and also contributes graphic solutions and proposals from scratch.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll collaborate with Project Managers and Producers to drive clarity, consistency and quality through all stages of the production process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll work as part of a global team of designers, illustrators, animators and art directors that produces world-class work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;The job is about harmonising style, craft intelligence, speed and scale to meet the evolving needs of brands for innovative and eye-catching content. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Pixel perfection and error-free ad content are important. You safeguard quality at all times and work together with visual QAs in order to achieve that.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;You have 3+ years of experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;You&#39;ve mastered Illustrator, Indesign, and Photoshop skills. Figma knowledge is a great plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;You know how to keep your files, layers, and folders super-organized, even if you’re a creative mess outside of Photoshop.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;You know how to work with dielines and different types of vendor specs for print projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Although you work under the supervision of a Lead who guarantees the quality of the work, you must also have the ability to work independently if the project requires it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;You can contribute to different stages of the production process, from setting styles and layouts to cutting formats and language versioning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;You are detail-oriented, pixel-perfect, methodic and solution-oriented.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;You’re always on the lookout for process efficiencies. Part of the responsibilities may include helping other designers with less experience. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;You can handle repetitive tasks and stay focused.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;You’re well-versed in English and production tricks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;You’re a clear communicator and are happy to work with designers from all over the world.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
