&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience working technical and platform tooling. Proficiency in data-driven troubleshooting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert in managing complex project timelines, tracking systems, and resource logs. Highly detail-oriented with a strong focus on delivery assurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to navigate large, cross-functional organizations and successfully bridge communications between creative agencies, data analysts, and engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
