&lt;p&gt;As a Project Manager, you’ll lead and oversee the delivery of end-to-end digital projects for our prominent clients, ensuring seamless execution from inception to completion. You will navigate complex technical environments and manage cross-functional teams to deliver exceptional digital experiences across a variety of platforms. We are looking for someone who is passionate about seeking new opportunities to create impactful work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organise project workflows, timelines, sprints, and resource allocation to ensure on-time and on-budget delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supervise cross-functional project teams, including developers, designers, and QA engineers, fostering a collaborative and efficient environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement tailored project management frameworks (such as Agile or Scrum) depending on the specific platform and tech stack requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage client communication, managing expectations, delivering status updates, and proactively troubleshooting project risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate deployment processes for platforms across digital transformation initiatives, web ecosystems, and mobile applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native fluency in Dutch (written and spoken) and full professional proficiency in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record as a Project Manager successfully leading mid-to-large-scale digital projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience working across multiple tech platforms, including full-scale digital transformations, complex web environments, and native mobile applications (iOS/Android).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical literacy with the ability to bridge communication gaps between technical development teams and non-technical client stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organisational, problem-solving, and time-management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Not a must, but a plus&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience managing projects or digital transformation contracts within the public sector or government agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant industry certifications (e.g., PRINCE2, Scrum Master/CSM, or PMP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Monks, we believe in fostering an environment where a diversity of perspectives can thrive. We proactively work to design hiring processes that promote equity and inclusion while mitigating bias. We celebrate diversity and are committed to building a team that reflects the communities we serve. We welcome and encourage qualified applicants, from all backgrounds, who are excited to contribute to our mission.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
