&lt;p&gt;As a Project Manager, you&#39;ll collaborate with cross-functional teams to define processes and to deliver high-quality results through well-managed, on time and on budget projects. Our ideal candidate is a fast and flexible go-getter who jumps on new opportunities, with a natural aptitude for collaboration and learning.&lt;/p&gt;
