&lt;li&gt;Develop and help define process both internally and across multiple agencies and their teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and manage project timelines, deliverables, and communication across assigned marketing programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with account management and finance on scoping and budget needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the appropriate resources are in place and manage their time day to day and hour to hour&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with teams to deliver on project scope of deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure quality control and review deliverables prepared by team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage trafficking creative for client review and feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track project changes and their impact on the cost/timeframe of project delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review project hours burn reports for program accuracy and risks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The essentials:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in a project management role, working closely with cross functional teams and clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in marketing campaign execution (e.g. ATL, BTL) and understanding of basic performance metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project timeline development and management skills&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple complex projects simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable in fast-paced environment, navigating uncertainty and prioritizing when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work as well independently as within a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical experience with marketing platforms&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High energy and go-getter attitude; comfortable working autonomously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable dealing with ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A plus:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative agency experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and experience with AI tools or/and agentic workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with scaled projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
