&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead, coach, and develop a team of Collections Specialists and Team Leads&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Oversee regional collections performance and drive achievement of cash collection, overdue debt, and DSO targets&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Monitor team KPIs, productivity, service levels, and collections reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Review aged debt and prioritize collection activity based on risk, value, and business impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
