&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Lowdown&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a Project Manager, you will be responsible for overseeing projects from initial client briefing through to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will initiate new projects by engaging relevant stakeholders and by serving as the primary point of contact for incoming client briefs and proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your role will be pivotal in ensuring successful project delivery, managing timelines, and exceeding client expectations by leading production efforts across different departments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be responsible for assembling the internal team and coordinating their efforts to ensure the successful completion of projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scope definition, project quoting, and production planning will fall under your purview to ensure project profitability and feasibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meeting monthly and annual targets will be crucial to fostering long-term success and growth for all involved parties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are seeking a candidate with at least 4 years of experience in managing regional productions, including digital ad campaigns, online videos, and live events, from proposal to final delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrated skills are essential, with a strong understanding of various production disciplines and techniques, particularly in the context of regional and localized production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ideal candidate will possess hands-on experience in overseeing high-quality deliverables and a deep understanding of the creative production process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in client engagement, business relationship management, and partnership development is crucial for this role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to handle high-stakes accounts and propose strategic next steps from a technical perspective is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A sharp comprehension of global brand objectives and the ability to quickly assess project challenges and goals are necessary for success in this role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An enthusiasm for exploring new technologies and industry trends is vital, as this knowledge will be instrumental in establishing realistic project costs and timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to focus on long-term partnerships and client relationship development is a key attribute that we are looking for in a Regional Project Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In summary, we are seeking a collaborative team player who can effectively manage projects across different teams, disciplines, time zones, and technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
