&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Please note that we will never request payment or bank account information at any stage of the recruitment process. As we continue to grow our teams, we urge you to be cautious of fraudulent job postings or recruitment activities that misuse our company name and information. Please protect your personal information during any recruitment process. While Monks may contact potential candidates via LinkedIn, all applications must be submitted through our official website (&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;monks.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Japan office is looking to hire a versatile Senior Account Director! As a Senior Account Director at Monks Tokyo, you have solid knowledge of the Digital Creative industry and an affinity with commercial landing pages, banners, video &amp;amp; still assets, film projects, television commercials, and digital content. You are someone who knows how to steward business relationships at the intersection of creativity and technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your role is to make sure our clients are completely satisfied, that our internal Monks teams know what to do and we deliver great projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand Video &amp;amp; Still production, landing pages, digital content creation, and e-Commerce, but if the conversation with the client becomes too substantive, you know it is time to invite the technical experts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will help clients by immersing yourself in their industry and you will link the insights to your in-depth knowledge of platforms, content creation, and e-Commerce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll help review and define the scope for each project, ensuring proposals meet the client&#39;s brief, and business objectives, above anything else.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You actively track project progress, maintaining full visibility on milestones, timelines, dependencies, and deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You keep a close eye on budget, hours, and scope, proactively flagging risks or changes to maintain financial and operational accuracy throughout the project lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience you already have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 8+ years of client-facing experience in digital advertising or creative production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong passion for digital platforms and content creation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can manage multiple priorities with ease — maintaining clear documentation, tracking milestones, and ensuring smooth delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You stay curious about new technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can create compelling decks and shape proposals from both technical and commercial angles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your presentation skills allow you to represent the team confidently to clients and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You communicate fluently in English and Japanese.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;#LI-CX1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Monks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks is the global, digital-first, data-driven, unitary operating brand of S4 Capital plc. With a legacy of innovation and specialized expertise, Monks combines an extraordinary range of global Marketing and Technology Services to redefine how brands interact with the world. Through Monks.Flow, its flagship AI ecosystem for marketing orchestration, Monks transforms marketing into a growth engine, collapsing timelines and connecting brands to culture in real time. By deploying bespoke intelligent agents across disciplines and delivering culturally relevant, high-impact creative and digital solutions, Monks solves key critical business challenges across the entire brand enterprise to help brands sustain long-term impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks was named a Contender in The Forrester Wave™: Global Marketing Services, ranks among Cannes Lions&#39; Top 10 Creative Companies (2022-25) and remains the only partner featured in AdExchanger’s Programmatic Power Players list every year (2020-24). Named Adweek’s first AI Agency of the Year (2023) and The One Show’s inaugural AI Pioneer Organization, Monks was also awarded Business Intelligence Group’s 2025 Excellence in Artificial Intelligence Award in both the Organizational and AI Product categories. As a trusted partner to cutting-edge innovators in tech, Monks earned titles such as Optimizely Experimentation Partner of the Year (2025), runner-up for the Adobe Firefly Partner Award (2024), and Workato’s AI Visionary Customer Impact Award (2024). Additionally, Monks achieved a record-breaking number of FWAs and continues to hold the most of any partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to building a respectful and empowering work environment for all people to freely express themselves amongst colleagues who embrace diversity in all respects. Including fresh voices and unique points of view in all aspects of our business not only creates an environment where we can all grow and thrive but also increases our potential to produce work that better represents—and resonates with—the world around us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Please note that we will never request payment or bank account information at any stage of the recruitment process. As we continue to grow our teams, we urge you to be cautious of fraudulent job postings or recruitment activities that misuse our company name and information. Please protect your personal information during any recruitment process. While Monks may contact potential candidates via LinkedIn, all applications must be submitted through our official website (&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;monks.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Account Manager, you’ll act as the strategic heart and commercial driving force for one of our key client accounts, blending high-level business growth with hands-on influencer marketing. Based in Madrid in a hybrid setup, you will be the trusted partner our clients turn to, unlocking new creative opportunities and leading pitches to grow our agency&#39;s footprint. You will bridge the gap between big-picture strategy and day-to-day project execution, ensuring our campaigns hit global standards of excellence while mentoring a cross-functional team of creatives and producers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone who is passionate about seeking new opportunities to create impactful work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead internal pitch processes and build relationships with prospective clients to win new business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage finances:&lt;/strong&gt; Take ownership of specific client revenue streams to ensure healthy, profitable, and sustainable accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spot opportunities:&lt;/strong&gt; Deeply understand your clients&#39; businesses to proactively suggest tailored solutions and unlock organic growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead client relationships:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the primary day-to-day point of contact for strategic client oversight, building long-term trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run accounts smoothly:&lt;/strong&gt; Set up and deliver clear account governance, making sure we fully meet our agreed service levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Head up influencer marketing:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify, source, and negotiate contracts with talent that align with campaign goals and brand values.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Oversee partnerships:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage end-to-end influencer collaborations, ensuring content performance metrics match campaign objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guide projects:&lt;/strong&gt; Review project briefs and ensure complex, international projects are delivered on schedule.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inspire teams:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage, mentor, and guide day-to-day workloads for junior team members and cross-functional teams (Creatives, Designers, Content Managers, and Producers).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Control quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee multiple campaigns, reviewing performance against key goals, and participate directly in on-set productions to deliver top-tier assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The essentials:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Over 5 years of experience in account management, with a track record of handling complex client portfolios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep insight into the Spanish market, including local agencies, partners, and vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cultural pulse:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong understanding of Gen Z culture and trends to execute modern, influencer-led campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Great communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional client-facing skills, sharp negotiation tactics, and the ability to confidently navigate difficult conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to manage multi-disciplinary teams in a fast-paced environment while meeting service agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Not a must, but a plus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A degree or background in Marketing, Communications, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
