&lt;li&gt;Thrive under pressure, adapt to changing priorities, and consistently meet tight deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate effectively with creative leads and copywriters, developing on-brand, strategically sound designs that meet brief requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present work with compelling rationale, demonstrating poise, professionalism, and clear communication skills, particularly when interacting with senior leaders and clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Combine creative and analytical thinking, asking insightful questions and critically assessing ideas from a conceptual standpoint.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience crafting brand style guides to ensure consistency across all touchpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
