&lt;li&gt;Lifestyle, luxury, technology, or automotive brand experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in vibe-coding and/or agentic workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motion, film, or content production experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading work across regional or global creative teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
