&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Excellent, full coverage medical, dental, and vision insurance - more about our coverage &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1flH9caNSGxiqlhz6kQP7XUaZCpzyIlKm/view?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO and 15 company-wide holidays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;401k with company contribution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Paid parental leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work-life balance with an emphasis on personal well-being&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Career growth in a disruptor space &amp;amp; entrepreneurial opportunities within the Monks network&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A globally diverse &amp;amp; inclusive culture with employee resource groups such as S4 Melanin, Pride.Monks, Cultura.Monks, and more!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Authentic commitment to DEI efforts and sustainable growth. (Why Sir Martin Sorrell signed The Climate Pledge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.adweek.com/agencies/s4-capital-continues-its-ambitious-evolution-by-joining-the-climate-pledge/?utm_content=154645660&amp;amp;utm_medium=social&amp;amp;utm_source=linkedin&amp;amp;hss_channel=lcp-2717758&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;!)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role is subject to our Return to Office (RTO) policy. If you reside within a commutable distance of one of our office locations, you will be expected to work from the office a set number of days per week. The specific details, including the number of required office days, will be in accordance with the company’s then-current RTO policy, which is subject to change from time to time.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Monks has provided a compensation range that represents its good faith estimate of what Monks may pay for the position at the time of posting. Monks may ultimately pay more or less than the posted compensation range. The salary offered to the selected candidate will be determined based on job-related factors, but not based on a candidate’s sex or any other protected status.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range: &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$95,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$105,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Monks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks is the global, digital-first, data-driven, unitary operating brand of S4 Capital plc. With a legacy of innovation and specialized expertise, Monks combines an extraordinary range of global Marketing and Technology Services to redefine how brands interact with the world. Through Monks.Flow, its flagship AI ecosystem for marketing orchestration, Monks transforms marketing into a growth engine, collapsing timelines and connecting brands to culture in real time. By deploying bespoke intelligent agents across disciplines and delivering culturally relevant, high-impact creative and digital solutions, Monks solves key critical business challenges across the entire brand enterprise to help brands sustain long-term impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks was named a Contender in The Forrester Wave™: Global Marketing Services, ranks among Cannes Lions&#39; Top 10 Creative Companies (2022-25) and remains the only partner featured in AdExchanger’s Programmatic Power Players list every year (2020-24). Named Adweek’s first AI Agency of the Year (2023) and The One Show’s inaugural AI Pioneer Organization, Monks was also awarded Business Intelligence Group’s 2025 Excellence in Artificial Intelligence Award in both the Organizational and AI Product categories. As a trusted partner to cutting-edge innovators in tech, Monks earned titles such as Optimizely Experimentation Partner of the Year (2025), runner-up for the Adobe Firefly Partner Award (2024), and Workato’s AI Visionary Customer Impact Award (2024). Additionally, Monks achieved a record-breaking number of FWAs and continues to hold the most of any partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to building a respectful and empowering work environment for all people to freely express themselves amongst colleagues who embrace diversity in all respects. Including fresh voices and unique points of view in all aspects of our business not only creates an environment where we can all grow and thrive but also increases our potential to produce work that better represents—and resonates with—the world around us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Please note that we will never request payment or bank account information at any stage of the recruitment process. As we continue to grow our teams, we urge you to be cautious of fraudulent job postings or recruitment activities that misuse our company name and information. Please protect your personal information during any recruitment process. While Monks may contact potential candidates via LinkedIn, all applications must be submitted through our official website (&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;monks.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Monks is a digital-first marketing and advertising services company connecting the dots across content, data &amp;amp; digital media and technology services. Inspired by the connectivity and flexibility of technology APIs, Media.Monks’ single-P&amp;amp;L model offers brands seamless access to a nearly 6,000-strong team of digital talent organized across 57 talent hubs in 33 countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With us, you&#39;ll find a diverse group of colleagues with different backgrounds and perspectives. We believe everyone has something of value to offer, and that sustaining a truly diverse, equitable and inclusive workplace begins with fostering an environment where people can be themselves, authentically, every day. We want to build something with the potential to change the heart of our industry, and we’d love to include your unique perspective. Now, about the opportunity: Media.Monks is hiring a brilliant and hyper-organized steward of client relations and internal project excellence for one of the world&#39;s highest–profile brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now the opportunity: We are looking for a Senior Producer to lead the production of dot-com websites, banners, advertising campaigns, mobile apps and other digital products and platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The individual will need to work in both English and Japanese and therefore have very strong fluency in Japanese to effectively work with the clients team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role &amp;amp; Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll frequently work face-to-face with our clients, occasionally embedding with them for sustained periods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll work as part of a small but fast-growing team of Monks to build out our reputation as the top creative production partner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a Senior Digital Producer, you specialize in setting up, stewarding and sustaining digital products such as brand apps, dot-com websites, digital transformation projects, digital advertising campaigns, and e-commerce platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You act as the initial bridge between Monks and new-business leads, introducing our company and capabilities alongside an amazing collection of platforms and assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You kick-start new projects by reaching out to the right people and by being the right person when people reach out to us — responding to agency briefs and RFPs and co-creating pitches, treatments and proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You shape new projects into a joint success by leading the production on our behalf: you’re the pace and peacemaker, principally responsible for projects’ timely and expectations-exceeding delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your role is to bring all of our in-house talent together and ensure great work is done between our office and our production strongholds around the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re responsible for scoping and quoting projects as well as timing and planning production work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You establish what gets done and when&amp;nbsp; making sure projects are profitable and doable, with realistic targets and deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meeting against monthly and annual targets, you help to grow business accounts into a long-term success for all parties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For this client-facing role, we’re looking for someone with 5+ years of experience producing high-end brand sites, digital ad campaigns, apps and e-comm platforms — leading digital projects from proposal to an actual product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have hands-on experience with producing high-end digital work and an intimate understanding of what is needed to make technical projects come about.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;With the backing of our global team of producers and tech directors, you’re confident in advising C-level clients on digital transformations and big redesign projects for websites and apps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can work in English &amp;amp; Japanese at the highest professional level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can handle high-stakes accounts and are confident proposing next steps from a strategic, technical perspective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a keen understanding of the (digital) business objectives of global brands and are able to quickly fathom a project’s challenges and what needs to be achieved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love to geek out when it comes to new technologies and trends, because while managing the client relationship is your foremost responsibility, you grasp technology in a way that allows you to establish realistic costs and timings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You don’t think in projects but in partnerships, developing client relationships and work-streams miles(tones) ahead&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;#LI-CX1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Monks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks is the global, digital-first, data-driven, unitary operating brand of S4 Capital plc. With a legacy of innovation and specialized expertise, Monks combines an extraordinary range of global Marketing and Technology Services to redefine how brands interact with the world. Through Monks.Flow, its flagship AI ecosystem for marketing orchestration, Monks transforms marketing into a growth engine, collapsing timelines and connecting brands to culture in real time. By deploying bespoke intelligent agents across disciplines and delivering culturally relevant, high-impact creative and digital solutions, Monks solves key critical business challenges across the entire brand enterprise to help brands sustain long-term impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks was named a Contender in The Forrester Wave™: Global Marketing Services, ranks among Cannes Lions&#39; Top 10 Creative Companies (2022-25) and remains the only partner featured in AdExchanger’s Programmatic Power Players list every year (2020-24). Named Adweek’s first AI Agency of the Year (2023) and The One Show’s inaugural AI Pioneer Organization, Monks was also awarded Business Intelligence Group’s 2025 Excellence in Artificial Intelligence Award in both the Organizational and AI Product categories. As a trusted partner to cutting-edge innovators in tech, Monks earned titles such as Optimizely Experimentation Partner of the Year (2025), runner-up for the Adobe Firefly Partner Award (2024), and Workato’s AI Visionary Customer Impact Award (2024). Additionally, Monks achieved a record-breaking number of FWAs and continues to hold the most of any partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to building a respectful and empowering work environment for all people to freely express themselves amongst colleagues who embrace diversity in all respects. Including fresh voices and unique points of view in all aspects of our business not only creates an environment where we can all grow and thrive but also increases our potential to produce work that better represents—and resonates with—the world around us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Please note that we will never request payment or bank account information at any stage of the recruitment process. As we continue to grow our teams, we urge you to be cautious of fraudulent job postings or recruitment activities that misuse our company name and information. Please protect your personal information during any recruitment process. While Monks may contact potential candidates via LinkedIn, all applications must be submitted through our official website (&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;monks.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are in search of a visionary Senior Creative Technologist AI to join our dynamic and forward-thinking team. This role fuses artistic imagination with the latest AI advancements, crafting distinctive visual content and revolutionizing creative workflows. As part of our global AI transformation team, you&#39;ll play a pivotal role in fast-tracking AI production processes for our talented creators worldwide, with a special emphasis on Monks America&#39;s Studios. Embrace the opportunity to shape the future of creativity at the intersection of marketing and technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Creative Technologist AI, you will be a vital force in shaping the future of digital experiences through the power of artificial intelligence. You will collaborate closely with cross-functional teams to ideate, prototype, and implement AI-driven solutions that push the boundaries of technology and creativity. Your expertise in AI, LLM, machine learning, and data-driven design will enable you to turn complex problems into innovative, intelligent applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES / PRIORITIES&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation &amp;amp; Concept Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with creative and technical teams to ideate and prototype new digital experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conceptualize, prototype and deliver creative applications of technologies in our digital and experiential projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll help win new projects by developing creative treatments in response to client briefs and RFPs, developing creative solutions that are exciting and in keeping with the project’s goals, timings and budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll visit clients to pitch for projects, participate in workshops, and woo people with your combination of creative thinking and technical know-how.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Communication: &lt;/strong&gt;Work closely with designers, developers, and clients to translate creative ideas into functional, beautiful, and technically sound solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bridging the gap between our clients, our creatives and our developers by speaking the language of all three.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the bridge between creative concepts and technical execution, providing insights on the feasibility and best technological approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Approach challenges with a solution-oriented mindset, finding creative ways to overcome technical and creative hurdles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The role involves a lot of tinkering, tweaking and testing; doing original R&amp;amp;D and playing around with new technologies and APIs, and creating original prototypes that work as a proof of concept.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;By figuring out the required technology and technical requirements, you usher creative projects to the development stage, liaising between creative and technical teams to make sure new projects work as advertised.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thought leader:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead creative on artificial intelligence in film, photo, animation, post production and other studio related projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On another level, you help to think and plan for the future, feeling the pulse of the AI field to figure out what platforms and technologies we should invest in to stay on top of the game&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES / DEEP DIVE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New business development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support ongoing client pitches; pitches often enable various levels of R&amp;amp;D against actual client challenges which, these pitches help us define the in market need, challenges, into buyable &amp;amp; winning proposals that are pushing our craft towards transformation on every level of the creative execution flow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pitch teams will have various discipline leads collaborating on workflow and R&amp;amp;D so that we represent the best of NOW.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Research &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prototyping &amp;amp; Experimentation: Rapidly prototype new ideas using a variety of tools and technologies, validating concepts through experimentation and iterative design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Emerging Technology Exploration: Stay ahead of the curve by exploring and experimenting with new technologies, platforms, and trends, and bring these insights to the team to inspire future projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role will push the creative craft and is responsible for creating and development of R&amp;amp;D projects that showcase high creative craft through AI enabled workflows.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A good amount of Client R&amp;amp;D as well as Proactive RD will be part of the role; to manage an area of playing, testing, discovering, to see where we can create meaningful transformation in craft.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role collaborates with a wider studio transformation team to be enabled across various disciplines to be able to work fast with quick results.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Code &amp;amp; Development: Write clean, efficient code as needed, contributing to the development of interactive features and dynamic web applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline Transformation – Monks.Flow Integration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads and supports discipline workflow transformation. We are set to transform every piece of production and are looking for artists that help support this transformation to ensure workflows are updated, tested and proven to be able to deliver on craft.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Once landed on the updated workflows this role will support automation teams to ensure areas of process that can be transformed are transformed/integrated correctly into the existing Monks AI related workflows &amp;amp;&amp;nbsp; toolstacks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimization of workflows: this role will ensure that net new tools that impact the discipline will get reviewed and tested proactively; as well as optimization updates are pushed for on the pipeline so that our workflows are always up to date in this fast moving landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Social Ambassador&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is comfortable representing our craft voice in our social media channels&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads net new R&amp;amp;D and has a weekly posting cadence into the new and unknown and forming vision and opinion on where the discipline is heading.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reviewing new tool stacks and features as part of the ongoing jobs and workflows&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative Craft Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A leader in craft and excellence pushing the boundaries of making on a day to day, project to project. Ensuring that we activate creative workflows that are new and pushing transformation of craft into the “never been done before area”&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has a proven track record in winning award per discipline&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads education internal and external; develops BTS and Educational case studies that allow us to share out with the larger organization to be able to bring awareness to the craft transformation this team is going through.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Monks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks is the global, digital-first, data-driven, unitary operating brand of S4 Capital plc. With a legacy of innovation and specialized expertise, Monks combines an extraordinary range of global Marketing and Technology Services to redefine how brands interact with the world. Through Monks.Flow, its flagship AI ecosystem for marketing orchestration, Monks transforms marketing into a growth engine, collapsing timelines and connecting brands to culture in real time. By deploying bespoke intelligent agents across disciplines and delivering culturally relevant, high-impact creative and digital solutions, Monks solves key critical business challenges across the entire brand enterprise to help brands sustain long-term impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks was named a Contender in The Forrester Wave™: Global Marketing Services, ranks among Cannes Lions&#39; Top 10 Creative Companies (2022-25) and remains the only partner featured in AdExchanger’s Programmatic Power Players list every year (2020-24). Named Adweek’s first AI Agency of the Year (2023) and The One Show’s inaugural AI Pioneer Organization, Monks was also awarded Business Intelligence Group’s 2025 Excellence in Artificial Intelligence Award in both the Organizational and AI Product categories. As a trusted partner to cutting-edge innovators in tech, Monks earned titles such as Optimizely Experimentation Partner of the Year (2025), runner-up for the Adobe Firefly Partner Award (2024), and Workato’s AI Visionary Customer Impact Award (2024). Additionally, Monks achieved a record-breaking number of FWAs and continues to hold the most of any partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to building a respectful and empowering work environment for all people to freely express themselves amongst colleagues who embrace diversity in all respects. Including fresh voices and unique points of view in all aspects of our business not only creates an environment where we can all grow and thrive but also increases our potential to produce work that better represents—and resonates with—the world around us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Please note that we will never request payment or bank account information at any stage of the recruitment process. As we continue to grow our teams, we urge you to be cautious of fraudulent job postings or recruitment activities that misuse our company name and information. Please protect your personal information during any recruitment process. While Monks may contact potential candidates via LinkedIn, all applications must be submitted through our official website (&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;monks.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Monks is seeking an experienced client-facing &lt;strong&gt;Senior Data Engineer (Marketing &amp;amp; BI) &lt;/strong&gt;to drive data and analytics delivery across marketing, audience, and e-commerce engagements for both small and large enterprise clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on role that blends business and data responsibilities. Your time will be split approximately 70% on client delivery and 30% internal (capability building, reusable assets, innovation, growth, etc). You’ll be focused on SQL-based data modelling and analytics delivery, and you’ll run client workshops and stakeholder management, while also building out solutions in the broader BI space, executing technical implementations across a range of analytics and cloud data platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate has a history of working with modern data products (e.g. BigQuery, Snowflake, Databricks, Redshift), and a proven track record of experience with the modern data stack based on cloud technologies, including data transformation, orchestration, warehousing and modelling, as well as BI and dashboard design using tools like Looker Studio, Power BI or Tableau.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Monks?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll help clients shape data pathways, translate data into insights and needs-based recommendations, deploy and configure the right tools, and improve data reliability, speed to insight, and KPI consistency. Working in the broader Data capability at Monks, this position offers opportunities for growth within our wider APAC data team with clear channels of progression into more senior roles, the ability to participate in innovation on projects and product development, and the potential to advance the practice of analytics and data from the forefront.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead requirements discovery and translate business questions into data/measurement solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design data models (dimensional/star schemas) to support scalable reporting and self-serve analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and model data across various cloud data warehouses (BigQuery/Snowflake/Databricks/Redshift) from marketing, web/app, and e-commerce sources; exact platform varies by client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Articulate, design and develop BI dashboards and custom reporting experiences using tools such as Looker Studio, Power BI and Tableau.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish data quality, monitoring, documentation, and governance practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with analytics/measurement teams on tracking approaches (GA4/GTM) to ensure usable downstream data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present insights and recommendations to senior stakeholders; influence roadmaps, estimation and prioritisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute reusable assets (templates, data patterns, dashboard standards) to the wider Monks APAC data capability.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of 6+ years experience in data engineering / analytics engineering / BI engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 3 year experience in client-facing delivery, consultancy or agency.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with BigQuery and at least one other cloud data platform (Snowflake, Databricks, Redshift, etc) required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert SQL skills, primarily in an ETL/ELT context; we are BigQuery first, but some Python is also favoured.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong dimensional modeling (star schemas), warehouse design, and metric/KPI definition for analytics use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building BI dashboards (Looker Studio, Power BI, Tableau).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with mainstream analytics platforms and data collection approaches, including Google Marketing Platform tooling (GTM, GA4, etc) preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with transformation and orchestration tools including dbt, Airflow, Dagster or Prefect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with broader enterprise BI platforms such as Looker (LookML/custom visualisations) or Datorama.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of the adtech/martech/data landscape; CRM &amp;amp; CDP familiarity is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Monks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks is the global, purely digital, unitary operating brand of S4Capital plc. With a legacy of innovation and specialized expertise, Monks combines an extraordinary range of global marketing and technology services to accelerate business possibilities and redefine how brands and businesses interact with the world. Its integration of systems and workflows delivers unfettered content production, scaled experiences, enterprise-grade technology and data science fueled by AI—managed by the industry’s best and most diverse digital talent—to help the world’s trailblazing companies outmaneuver and outpace their competition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks was named a Contender in The Forrester Wave™: Global Marketing Services. It has remained a constant presence on Adweek’s Fastest Growing lists (2019-23), ranks among Cannes Lions&#39; Top 10 Creative Companies (2022-23) and is the only partner to have been placed in AdExchanger’s Programmatic Power Players list every year (2020-24). In addition to being named Adweek’s first AI Agency of the Year (2023), Monks has been recognized by Business Intelligence in its 2024 Excellence in Artificial Intelligence Awards program in three categories: the Individual category, Organizational Winner in AI Strategic Planning and AI Product for its service Monks.Flow. Monks has also garnered the title of Webby Production Company of the Year (2021-24), won a record number of FWAs and has earned a spot on Newsweek’s Top 100 Global Most Loved Workplaces 2023.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to building a respectful and empowering work environment for all people to freely express themselves amongst colleagues who embrace diversity in all respects. Including fresh voices and unique points of view in all aspects of our business not only creates an environment where we can all grow and thrive but also increases our potential to produce work that better represents—and resonates with—the world around us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;#LI-CX1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Monks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks is the global, digital-first, data-driven, unitary operating brand of S4 Capital plc. With a legacy of innovation and specialized expertise, Monks combines an extraordinary range of global Marketing and Technology Services to redefine how brands interact with the world. Through Monks.Flow, its flagship AI ecosystem for marketing orchestration, Monks transforms marketing into a growth engine, collapsing timelines and connecting brands to culture in real time. By deploying bespoke intelligent agents across disciplines and delivering culturally relevant, high-impact creative and digital solutions, Monks solves key critical business challenges across the entire brand enterprise to help brands sustain long-term impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks was named a Contender in The Forrester Wave™: Global Marketing Services, ranks among Cannes Lions&#39; Top 10 Creative Companies (2022-25) and remains the only partner featured in AdExchanger’s Programmatic Power Players list every year (2020-24). Named Adweek’s first AI Agency of the Year (2023) and The One Show’s inaugural AI Pioneer Organization, Monks was also awarded Business Intelligence Group’s 2025 Excellence in Artificial Intelligence Award in both the Organizational and AI Product categories. As a trusted partner to cutting-edge innovators in tech, Monks earned titles such as Optimizely Experimentation Partner of the Year (2025), runner-up for the Adobe Firefly Partner Award (2024), and Workato’s AI Visionary Customer Impact Award (2024). Additionally, Monks achieved a record-breaking number of FWAs and continues to hold the most of any partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
