&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s Degree in Computer Science or equivalent in Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in operational roles (Cloud Operations, Site Reliability, DevOps, etc...)&lt;/li&gt;
