&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Please note that we will never request payment or bank account information at any stage of the recruitment process. As we continue to grow our teams, we urge you to be cautious of fraudulent job postings or recruitment activities that misuse our company name and information. Please protect your personal information during any recruitment process. While Monks may contact potential candidates via LinkedIn, all applications must be submitted through our official website (&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;monks.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Monks is a digital-first marketing and advertising services company connecting the dots across content, data &amp;amp; digital media and technology services. Inspired by the connectivity and flexibility of technology APIs, Media.Monks’ single-P&amp;amp;L model offers brands seamless access to a nearly 6,000-strong team of digital talent organized across 57 talent hubs in 33 countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With us, you&#39;ll find a diverse group of colleagues with different backgrounds and perspectives. We believe everyone has something of value to offer, and that sustaining a truly diverse, equitable and inclusive workplace begins with fostering an environment where people can be themselves, authentically, every day. We want to build something with the potential to change the heart of our industry, and we’d love to include your unique perspective. Now, about the opportunity: Media.Monks is hiring a brilliant and hyper-organized steward of client relations and internal project excellence for one of the world&#39;s highest–profile brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now the opportunity: We are looking for a Senior Digital Producer/Project Manager to lead the production of dot-com websites, banners, advertising campaigns, mobile apps and other digital products and platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The individual will need to work in both English and Japanese and therefore have very strong fluency in Japanese to effectively work with the clients team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role &amp;amp; Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll frequently work face-to-face with our clients, occasionally embedding with them for sustained periods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll work as part of a small but fast-growing team of Monks to build out our reputation as the top creative production partner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a Senior Digital Producer, you specialize in setting up, stewarding and sustaining digital products such as brand apps, dot-com websites, digital transformation projects, digital advertising campaigns, and e-commerce platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You act as the initial bridge between Monks and new-business leads, introducing our company and capabilities alongside an amazing collection of platforms and assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You kick-start new projects by reaching out to the right people and by being the right person when people reach out to us — responding to agency briefs and RFPs and co-creating pitches, treatments and proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You shape new projects into a joint success by leading the production on our behalf: you’re the pace and peacemaker, principally responsible for projects’ timely and expectations-exceeding delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your role is to bring all of our in-house talent together and ensure great work is done between our office and our production strongholds around the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re responsible for scoping and quoting projects as well as timing and planning production work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You establish what gets done and when&amp;nbsp; making sure projects are profitable and doable, with realistic targets and deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meeting against monthly and annual targets, you help to grow business accounts into a long-term success for all parties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For this client-facing role, we’re looking for someone with 5+ years of experience producing high-end brand sites, digital ad campaigns, apps and e-comm platforms — leading digital projects from proposal to an actual product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have hands-on experience with producing high-end digital work and an intimate understanding of what is needed to make technical projects come about.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;With the backing of our global team of producers and tech directors, you’re confident in advising C-level clients on digital transformations and big redesign projects for websites and apps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can work in English &amp;amp; Japanese at the highest professional level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can handle high-stakes accounts and are confident proposing next steps from a strategic, technical perspective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a keen understanding of the (digital) business objectives of global brands and are able to quickly fathom a project’s challenges and what needs to be achieved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love to geek out when it comes to new technologies and trends, because while managing the client relationship is your foremost responsibility, you grasp technology in a way that allows you to establish realistic costs and timings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You don’t think in projects but in partnerships, developing client relationships and work-streams miles(tones) ahead&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;#LI-CX1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Monks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks is the global, digital-first, data-driven, unitary operating brand of S4 Capital plc. With a legacy of innovation and specialized expertise, Monks combines an extraordinary range of global Marketing and Technology Services to redefine how brands interact with the world. Through Monks.Flow, its flagship AI ecosystem for marketing orchestration, Monks transforms marketing into a growth engine, collapsing timelines and connecting brands to culture in real time. By deploying bespoke intelligent agents across disciplines and delivering culturally relevant, high-impact creative and digital solutions, Monks solves key critical business challenges across the entire brand enterprise to help brands sustain long-term impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks was named a Contender in The Forrester Wave™: Global Marketing Services, ranks among Cannes Lions&#39; Top 10 Creative Companies (2022-25) and remains the only partner featured in AdExchanger’s Programmatic Power Players list every year (2020-24). Named Adweek’s first AI Agency of the Year (2023) and The One Show’s inaugural AI Pioneer Organization, Monks was also awarded Business Intelligence Group’s 2025 Excellence in Artificial Intelligence Award in both the Organizational and AI Product categories. As a trusted partner to cutting-edge innovators in tech, Monks earned titles such as Optimizely Experimentation Partner of the Year (2025), runner-up for the Adobe Firefly Partner Award (2024), and Workato’s AI Visionary Customer Impact Award (2024). Additionally, Monks achieved a record-breaking number of FWAs and continues to hold the most of any partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to building a respectful and empowering work environment for all people to freely express themselves amongst colleagues who embrace diversity in all respects. Including fresh voices and unique points of view in all aspects of our business not only creates an environment where we can all grow and thrive but also increases our potential to produce work that better represents—and resonates with—the world around us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Please note that we will never request payment or bank account information at any stage of the recruitment process. As we continue to grow our teams, we urge you to be cautious of fraudulent job postings or recruitment activities that misuse our company name and information. Please protect your personal information during any recruitment process. While Monks may contact potential candidates via LinkedIn, all applications must be submitted through our official website (&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;monks.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a senior, delivery-first role for an experienced engagement professional who thrives in complex, multi-workstream environments. As Senior Digital Project Manager you will be the operational backbone of our Australian client engagements - running the end-to-end delivery engine while working in close partnership with onshore Engagement Managers and the Director of Client Partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will not just execute - you will elevate. You bring strong project management rigour, a continuous improvement mindset, and enough client-facing capability to contribute meaningfully to stakeholder conversations when needed. You thrive on building systems, identifying delivery gaps, and setting the standard for how work gets done.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;1. Delivery Leadership &amp;amp; Project Governance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take end-to-end accountability for the delivery of complex, multi-workstream data and analytics engagements across the Australian client portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the project management lifecycle — scoping, planning, resourcing, execution, quality assurance, and closure — across multiple concurrent accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and enforce delivery standards, change control procedures, and escalation frameworks across all active engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain real-time visibility of delivery health across your accounts — proactively flag risks, resolve blockers, and manage competing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead sprint planning, stand-ups, and delivery reviews with offshore squads — keep momentum high and accountability clear.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2. Continuous Improvement &amp;amp; Process Development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify gaps, inefficiencies, and recurring delivery issues — then build systems, templates, and playbooks to fix them at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish repeatable delivery frameworks that can be adopted across the wider team — onboarding, QA checklists, handover protocols, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run retrospectives and lessons learned sessions after key delivery milestones, turning insight into action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion a culture of quality and continuous improvement within the delivery team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the Director of Client Partnerships to shape the delivery operating model as the team grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3. Client Engagement &amp;amp; Stakeholder Support&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with onshore Engagement Managers to ensure delivery context is clearly communicated to clients at all times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in client-facing delivery reviews, QBRs, and milestone presentations where appropriate — contribute to the narrative around delivery progress and next steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clear and proactive communication with onshore counterparts — no surprises, ever.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support SOW scoping by providing accurate effort estimates, resource plans, and delivery assumptions based on hands-on experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;4. Commercial &amp;amp; SOW Accountability&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate within agreed SOW scope and budget — track actuals vs. estimates and flag variances early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enforce scope governance rigorously — identify out-of-scope requests, assess impact, and feed back into the commercial conversation with the Engagement Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to accurate and timely invoicing by providing delivery milestones, hours logged, and completion sign-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years in technical project delivery, engagement management, or digital consulting — preferably in data, analytics, or MarTech&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to run complex, multi-workstream projects with strict governance, change control, and quality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of identifying delivery problems and building systems to solve them — not just fixing the symptom.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and developing offshore or cross-functional teams. Comfortable holding people accountable with empathy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of data and analytics platforms (GA4, Adobe Analytics, GCP, BigQuery, etc.). Able to QA technical outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, structured communicator — able to synthesise delivery complexity into concise updates for onshore EMs and client stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PMP, PRINCE2, or equivalent project management certification.&amp;nbsp;Exposure to Agile delivery frameworks (Scrum, Kanban) and experience running hybrid delivery models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and scaling delivery processes in a consulting or professional services context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with platform ecosystem: Google Marketing Platform, Adobe Experience Platform, Salesforce Marketing Cloud, or similar highly desirable&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Australian enterprise clients or in a global delivery model would be a plus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;#LI-CX1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Monks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks is the global, digital-first, data-driven, unitary operating brand of S4 Capital plc. With a legacy of innovation and specialized expertise, Monks combines an extraordinary range of global Marketing and Technology Services to redefine how brands interact with the world. Through Monks.Flow, its flagship AI ecosystem for marketing orchestration, Monks transforms marketing into a growth engine, collapsing timelines and connecting brands to culture in real time. By deploying bespoke intelligent agents across disciplines and delivering culturally relevant, high-impact creative and digital solutions, Monks solves key critical business challenges across the entire brand enterprise to help brands sustain long-term impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks was named a Contender in The Forrester Wave™: Global Marketing Services, ranks among Cannes Lions&#39; Top 10 Creative Companies (2022-25) and remains the only partner featured in AdExchanger’s Programmatic Power Players list every year (2020-24). Named Adweek’s first AI Agency of the Year (2023) and The One Show’s inaugural AI Pioneer Organization, Monks was also awarded Business Intelligence Group’s 2025 Excellence in Artificial Intelligence Award in both the Organizational and AI Product categories. As a trusted partner to cutting-edge innovators in tech, Monks earned titles such as Optimizely Experimentation Partner of the Year (2025), runner-up for the Adobe Firefly Partner Award (2024), and Workato’s AI Visionary Customer Impact Award (2024). Additionally, Monks achieved a record-breaking number of FWAs and continues to hold the most of any partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to building a respectful and empowering work environment for all people to freely express themselves amongst colleagues who embrace diversity in all respects. Including fresh voices and unique points of view in all aspects of our business not only creates an environment where we can all grow and thrive but also increases our potential to produce work that better represents—and resonates with—the world around us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Please note that we will never request payment or bank account information at any stage of the recruitment process. As we continue to grow our teams, we urge you to be cautious of fraudulent job postings or recruitment activities that misuse our company name and information. Please protect your personal information during any recruitment process. While Monks may contact potential candidates via LinkedIn, all applications must be submitted through our official website (&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;monks.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Monks is a digital-first marketing and advertising services company connecting the dots across content, data &amp;amp; digital media and technology services. Inspired by the connectivity and flexibility of technology APIs, Media.Monks’ single-P&amp;amp;L model offers brands seamless access to a nearly 6,000-strong team of digital talent organized across 57 talent hubs in 33 countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With us, you&#39;ll find a diverse group of colleagues with different backgrounds and perspectives. We believe everyone has something of value to offer, and that sustaining a truly diverse, equitable and inclusive workplace begins with fostering an environment where people can be themselves, authentically, every day. We want to build something with the potential to change the heart of our industry, and we’d love to include your unique perspective. Now, about the opportunity: Media.Monks is hiring a brilliant and hyper-organized steward of client relations and internal project excellence for one of the world&#39;s highest–profile brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now the opportunity: We are looking for a Senior Digital Producer/Project Manager to lead the production of dot-com websites, banners, advertising campaigns, mobile apps and other digital products and platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The individual will need to work in both English and Japanese and therefore have very strong fluency in Japanese to effectively work with the clients team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role &amp;amp; Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll frequently work face-to-face with our clients, occasionally embedding with them for sustained periods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll work as part of a small but fast-growing team of Monks to build out our reputation as the top creative production partner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a Senior Digital Producer, you specialize in setting up, stewarding and sustaining digital products such as brand apps, dot-com websites, digital transformation projects, digital advertising campaigns, and e-commerce platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You act as the initial bridge between Monks and new-business leads, introducing our company and capabilities alongside an amazing collection of platforms and assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You kick-start new projects by reaching out to the right people and by being the right person when people reach out to us — responding to agency briefs and RFPs and co-creating pitches, treatments and proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You shape new projects into a joint success by leading the production on our behalf: you’re the pace and peacemaker, principally responsible for projects’ timely and expectations-exceeding delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your role is to bring all of our in-house talent together and ensure great work is done between our office and our production strongholds around the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re responsible for scoping and quoting projects as well as timing and planning production work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You establish what gets done and when&amp;nbsp; making sure projects are profitable and doable, with realistic targets and deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meeting against monthly and annual targets, you help to grow business accounts into a long-term success for all parties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For this client-facing role, we’re looking for someone with 5+ years of experience producing high-end brand sites, digital ad campaigns, apps and e-comm platforms — leading digital projects from proposal to an actual product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have hands-on experience with producing high-end digital work and an intimate understanding of what is needed to make technical projects come about.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;With the backing of our global team of producers and tech directors, you’re confident in advising C-level clients on digital transformations and big redesign projects for websites and apps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can work in English &amp;amp; Japanese at the highest professional level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can handle high-stakes accounts and are confident proposing next steps from a strategic, technical perspective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a keen understanding of the (digital) business objectives of global brands and are able to quickly fathom a project’s challenges and what needs to be achieved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love to geek out when it comes to new technologies and trends, because while managing the client relationship is your foremost responsibility, you grasp technology in a way that allows you to establish realistic costs and timings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You don’t think in projects but in partnerships, developing client relationships and work-streams miles(tones) ahead&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;#LI-CX1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Monks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks is the global, digital-first, data-driven, unitary operating brand of S4 Capital plc. With a legacy of innovation and specialized expertise, Monks combines an extraordinary range of global Marketing and Technology Services to redefine how brands interact with the world. Through Monks.Flow, its flagship AI ecosystem for marketing orchestration, Monks transforms marketing into a growth engine, collapsing timelines and connecting brands to culture in real time. By deploying bespoke intelligent agents across disciplines and delivering culturally relevant, high-impact creative and digital solutions, Monks solves key critical business challenges across the entire brand enterprise to help brands sustain long-term impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks was named a Contender in The Forrester Wave™: Global Marketing Services, ranks among Cannes Lions&#39; Top 10 Creative Companies (2022-25) and remains the only partner featured in AdExchanger’s Programmatic Power Players list every year (2020-24). Named Adweek’s first AI Agency of the Year (2023) and The One Show’s inaugural AI Pioneer Organization, Monks was also awarded Business Intelligence Group’s 2025 Excellence in Artificial Intelligence Award in both the Organizational and AI Product categories. As a trusted partner to cutting-edge innovators in tech, Monks earned titles such as Optimizely Experimentation Partner of the Year (2025), runner-up for the Adobe Firefly Partner Award (2024), and Workato’s AI Visionary Customer Impact Award (2024). Additionally, Monks achieved a record-breaking number of FWAs and continues to hold the most of any partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to building a respectful and empowering work environment for all people to freely express themselves amongst colleagues who embrace diversity in all respects. Including fresh voices and unique points of view in all aspects of our business not only creates an environment where we can all grow and thrive but also increases our potential to produce work that better represents—and resonates with—the world around us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Please note that we will never request payment or bank account information at any stage of the recruitment process. As we continue to grow our teams, we urge you to be cautious of fraudulent job postings or recruitment activities that misuse our company name and information. Please protect your personal information during any recruitment process. While Monks may contact potential candidates via LinkedIn, all applications must be submitted through our official website (&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;monks.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;350&quot; data-end=&quot;398&quot;&gt;Senior Director, Strategy – Brand &amp;amp; Creative&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll lead our Brand Strategy discipline within this team. We&#39;re looking for someone who is passionate about building breakthrough brands, developing bold strategic thinking, and creating impactful work that moves businesses and culture forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;648&quot; data-end=&quot;657&quot;&gt;TL;DR&lt;/strong&gt; – You&#39;ve already done this for global brands on some of the world&#39;s biggest stages. You&#39;ve been in the room when major decisions are made and know how to earn your seat there. You care more about the work being great than being right. You know the difference between a brand truth and a brand claim—and can teach others. &lt;strong data-start=&quot;979&quot; data-end=&quot;1179&quot;&gt;You&#39;ve built brand strategy that doesn&#39;t stop at the brief. You know how great brand platforms translate into integrated campaigns, digital experiences, product launches, and customer touchpoints.&lt;/strong&gt; Most importantly, you&#39;re excited by the opportunity to build and grow a modern Brand Strategy practice within a highly collaborative, AI-forward agency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Global Brand Positioning:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead development of foundational brand strategy, architecture, and positioning for this industry-defining tech giant across its full product portfolio. Make sure the brand stays consistent, clear and relevant whether it&#39;s showing up in São Paulo, Seoul, or San Francisco.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;High-Stakes Creative Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive the strategic vision for highly-visible campaigns (e.g. Super Bowl spots, Olympics moments, global product launches, major repositionings). You&#39;ve been in these rooms before and you know how to lead when the stakes are high.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Creative Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; Be the right hand to our Group Creative Directors. Write briefs that are provocative and inspiring and stay deeply engaged through the creative process to protect and elevate the core idea from brief to final cut.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Cultural Intelligence:&lt;/strong&gt; Keep a genuine pulse on where culture is moving: what people care about, what&#39;s shifting, what&#39;s coming. Bring that fluency into the work before clients ask for it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Practice Building: Mentorship:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage and mentor a team of brand strategists — directors, seniors, and beyond. Foster an environment where rigorous thinking, creative ambition, collaboration, and curiosity thrive together. Establish best practices, elevate the discipline, and contribute to building a world-class strategy organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Client Advisory &amp;amp; Business Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Build real, trusted relationships with senior marketing leaders at this multi-platform digital consumer and enterprise empire. Facilitate strategic conversations, confidently present recommendations, and influence key business decisions. Partner with Client Leadership and Creative teams to identify new opportunities, support proactive thinking, and lead strategic components of new business pitches.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with media, data, and AI teams to make sure the brand platform doesn&#39;t live in a deck — it translates into a full-funnel consumer experience, built with the speed and agility&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;a pioneering, fast-paced Silicon Valley innovator expects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The essentials:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1052&quot; data-end=&quot;1170&quot;&gt;12+ years in Brand Planning or Creative Strategy at a top agency, with at least 3 years in a senior leadership role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1172&quot; data-end=&quot;1277&quot;&gt;You&#39;ve worked on major global brands and campaigns that ran everywhere, on briefs that had real stakes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1279&quot; data-end=&quot;1481&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1281&quot; data-end=&quot;1481&quot;&gt;You&#39;ve built brand strategy that doesn&#39;t stop at the brief. You know how great brand platforms translate into integrated campaigns, digital experiences, product launches, and customer touchpoints.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1483&quot; data-end=&quot;1646&quot;&gt;Direct experience on high-profile, high-stakes campaigns: Super Bowl, Olympics, global product launches, or equivalent moments where the whole world is watching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1648&quot; data-end=&quot;1744&quot;&gt;You know how to build a global brand platform—not just a campaign, but the idea underneath it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1746&quot; data-end=&quot;1881&quot;&gt;The ability to take complex data and research and turn it into a simple, compelling idea that a creative team is excited to run with.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1883&quot; data-end=&quot;2039&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1885&quot; data-end=&quot;2039&quot;&gt;You&#39;ve partnered closely with Executive Creative Directors and know how to challenge, inspire, and elevate creative work from brief through execution.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2041&quot; data-end=&quot;2175&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2043&quot; data-end=&quot;2175&quot;&gt;You&#39;ve helped win new business and are comfortable leading the strategic portions of pitches and executive client presentations.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2177&quot; data-end=&quot;2322&quot;&gt;A track record of building and leading high-performing strategy teams. You&#39;re an empathetic leader who knows how to get the best out of people.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2324&quot; data-end=&quot;2438&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2326&quot; data-end=&quot;2438&quot;&gt;You&#39;re excited by the opportunity to build and grow a modern Brand Strategy practice—not simply inherit one.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2440&quot; data-end=&quot;2560&quot;&gt;You can command a room, sell a brave idea to a skeptical stakeholder, and always articulate the &quot;why&quot; behind the work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2562&quot; data-end=&quot;2660&quot;&gt;Genuine curiosity about AI as a creative and strategic tool, not just a capability to check off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Compensation:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The anticipated salary range for this role varies by geographic location. Actual compensation will be determined based on a variety of factors, including relevant experience, interview assessment, skills, geographic location, and internal equity. In addition to base salary, Monks offers a comprehensive benefits package and opportunities for professional growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-ZZ1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Monks, we believe in fostering an environment where a diversity of perspectives can thrive. We proactively work to design hiring processes that promote equity and inclusion while mitigating bias. We celebrate diversity and are committed to building a team that reflects the communities we serve. We welcome and encourage qualified applicants, from all backgrounds, who are excited to contribute to our mission.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role is subject to our Return to Office (RTO) policy. If you reside within a commutable distance of one of our office locations, you will be expected to work from the office a set number of days per week. The specific details, including the number of required office days, will be in accordance with the company’s then-current RTO policy, which is subject to change from time to time.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Excellent, full coverage medical, dental, and vision insurance - more about our coverage &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1flH9caNSGxiqlhz6kQP7XUaZCpzyIlKm/view?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO and 15 company-wide holidays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;401k with company contribution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Paid parental leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work-life balance with an emphasis on personal well-being&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Career growth in a disruptor space &amp;amp; entrepreneurial opportunities within the Monks network&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A globally diverse &amp;amp; inclusive culture with employee resource groups such as S4 Melanin, Pride.Monks, Cultura.Monks, and more!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Authentic commitment to DEI efforts and sustainable growth. (Why Sir Martin Sorrell signed The Climate Pledge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.adweek.com/agencies/s4-capital-continues-its-ambitious-evolution-by-joining-the-climate-pledge/?utm_content=154645660&amp;amp;utm_medium=social&amp;amp;utm_source=linkedin&amp;amp;hss_channel=lcp-2717758&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;!)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role is subject to our Return to Office (RTO) policy. If you reside within a commutable distance of one of our office locations, you will be expected to work from the office a set number of days per week. The specific details, including the number of required office days, will be in accordance with the company’s then-current RTO policy, which is subject to change from time to time.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
