&lt;p&gt;A keen eye for detail, a sense of ownership, and a commitment to producing high-quality work are essential. Additionally, you should be able to seamlessly transition between design and motion design tasks, delivering high-quality files that meet both organisational and aesthetic standards.&lt;/p&gt;
