&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute omnichannel marketing strategies across Google Ads, Paid Social Media (Facebook, Instagram, LinkedIn, Twitter, etc.), and Programmatic channels.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with stakeholders (DMMs, PMMs, Strategy Directors) to dive deep into product marketing strategy, make recommendations, and ensure alignment across channels.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Digital Marketing optimizers on forecasting, campaign launch timing, sizing, and performance optimization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with campaign execution, landing page creation, and budget management, ensuring delivery against forecasts and objectives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track, share, and manage benchmarks and performance standards across the team, empowering marketers with data and tools for success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze data, surface challenges, and collaborate with optimizers to resolve roadblocks.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain deep expertise in Google Ads, Programmatic platforms (DV360 preferred), Paid Social platforms, finance, legal, and brand safety policies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create, implement, and maintain reporting scripts and dashboards across channels.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multiple projects and competing deadlines efficiently.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate excellent written and verbal communication with all stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work effectively both independently and within a fast-paced, collaborative team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we&#39;re looking for:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-7+ years of marketing experience, ideally in performance marketing with experience across Google Ads, Paid Social Media, and Programmatic platforms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BA/BS degree (Business, Finance, Marketing, or equivalent) preferred.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Excel/Google Sheets user (functions like vlookup, pivot tables, formulas, sheet optimizations) for forecasting, reporting, and data analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data analytics and operations skills, with a passion for data-driven decision making.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organizational skills and expertise in managing complex marketing campaign logistics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of website creation and landing page optimization. Experience with A/B Testing and reporting across channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional presentation skills, comfortable speaking about and presenting data to clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional management skills, comfortable collaborating with diverse stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relationship builder with excellent verbal and written communication skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with digital marketing concepts and industry trends.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Superior project management skills and the ability to handle multiple complex projects simultaneously.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in a fast-paced environment and adapts to ambiguity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Plus:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree with strong academic performance and analytical success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Ad Servers, campaign optimization tools, and online tracking technologies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Google Marketing Platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It’s essential to have advanced and conversational English at level C1.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
