&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Please note that we will never request payment or bank account information at any stage of the recruitment process. As we continue to grow our teams, we urge you to be cautious of fraudulent job postings or recruitment activities that misuse our company name and information. Please protect your personal information during any recruitment process. While Monks may contact potential candidates via LinkedIn, all applications must be submitted through our official website (&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;monks.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Monks is a digital-first marketing and advertising services company connecting the dots across content, data &amp;amp; digital media and technology services. Inspired by the connectivity and flexibility of technology APIs, Media.Monks’ single-P&amp;amp;L model offers brands seamless access to a nearly 6,000-strong team of digital talent organized across 57 talent hubs in 33 countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With us, you&#39;ll find a diverse group of colleagues with different backgrounds and perspectives. We believe everyone has something of value to offer, and that sustaining a truly diverse, equitable and inclusive workplace begins with fostering an environment where people can be themselves, authentically, every day. We want to build something with the potential to change the heart of our industry, and we’d love to include your unique perspective. Now, about the opportunity: Media.Monks is hiring a brilliant and hyper-organized steward of client relations and internal project excellence for one of the world&#39;s highest–profile brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now the opportunity: We are looking for a Senior Producer to lead the production of dot-com websites, banners, advertising campaigns, mobile apps and other digital products and platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The individual will need to work in both English and Japanese and therefore have very strong fluency in Japanese to effectively work with the clients team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role &amp;amp; Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll frequently work face-to-face with our clients, occasionally embedding with them for sustained periods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll work as part of a small but fast-growing team of Monks to build out our reputation as the top creative production partner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a Senior Digital Producer, you specialize in setting up, stewarding and sustaining digital products such as brand apps, dot-com websites, digital transformation projects, digital advertising campaigns, and e-commerce platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You act as the initial bridge between Monks and new-business leads, introducing our company and capabilities alongside an amazing collection of platforms and assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You kick-start new projects by reaching out to the right people and by being the right person when people reach out to us — responding to agency briefs and RFPs and co-creating pitches, treatments and proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You shape new projects into a joint success by leading the production on our behalf: you’re the pace and peacemaker, principally responsible for projects’ timely and expectations-exceeding delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your role is to bring all of our in-house talent together and ensure great work is done between our office and our production strongholds around the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re responsible for scoping and quoting projects as well as timing and planning production work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You establish what gets done and when&amp;nbsp; making sure projects are profitable and doable, with realistic targets and deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meeting against monthly and annual targets, you help to grow business accounts into a long-term success for all parties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For this client-facing role, we’re looking for someone with 5+ years of experience producing high-end brand sites, digital ad campaigns, apps and e-comm platforms — leading digital projects from proposal to an actual product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have hands-on experience with producing high-end digital work and an intimate understanding of what is needed to make technical projects come about.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;With the backing of our global team of producers and tech directors, you’re confident in advising C-level clients on digital transformations and big redesign projects for websites and apps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can work in English &amp;amp; Japanese at the highest professional level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can handle high-stakes accounts and are confident proposing next steps from a strategic, technical perspective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a keen understanding of the (digital) business objectives of global brands and are able to quickly fathom a project’s challenges and what needs to be achieved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love to geek out when it comes to new technologies and trends, because while managing the client relationship is your foremost responsibility, you grasp technology in a way that allows you to establish realistic costs and timings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You don’t think in projects but in partnerships, developing client relationships and work-streams miles(tones) ahead&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;#LI-CX1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Monks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks is the global, digital-first, data-driven, unitary operating brand of S4 Capital plc. With a legacy of innovation and specialized expertise, Monks combines an extraordinary range of global Marketing and Technology Services to redefine how brands interact with the world. Through Monks.Flow, its flagship AI ecosystem for marketing orchestration, Monks transforms marketing into a growth engine, collapsing timelines and connecting brands to culture in real time. By deploying bespoke intelligent agents across disciplines and delivering culturally relevant, high-impact creative and digital solutions, Monks solves key critical business challenges across the entire brand enterprise to help brands sustain long-term impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks was named a Contender in The Forrester Wave™: Global Marketing Services, ranks among Cannes Lions&#39; Top 10 Creative Companies (2022-25) and remains the only partner featured in AdExchanger’s Programmatic Power Players list every year (2020-24). Named Adweek’s first AI Agency of the Year (2023) and The One Show’s inaugural AI Pioneer Organization, Monks was also awarded Business Intelligence Group’s 2025 Excellence in Artificial Intelligence Award in both the Organizational and AI Product categories. As a trusted partner to cutting-edge innovators in tech, Monks earned titles such as Optimizely Experimentation Partner of the Year (2025), runner-up for the Adobe Firefly Partner Award (2024), and Workato’s AI Visionary Customer Impact Award (2024). Additionally, Monks achieved a record-breaking number of FWAs and continues to hold the most of any partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to building a respectful and empowering work environment for all people to freely express themselves amongst colleagues who embrace diversity in all respects. Including fresh voices and unique points of view in all aspects of our business not only creates an environment where we can all grow and thrive but also increases our potential to produce work that better represents—and resonates with—the world around us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Please note that we will never request payment or bank account information at any stage of the recruitment process. As we continue to grow our teams, we urge you to be cautious of fraudulent job postings or recruitment activities that misuse our company name and information. Please protect your personal information during any recruitment process. While Monks may contact potential candidates via LinkedIn, all applications must be submitted through our official website (&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;monks.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;1275&quot; data-end=&quot;1296&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1278&quot; data-end=&quot;1296&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1298&quot; data-end=&quot;1756&quot;&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1303&quot; data-end=&quot;1322&quot;&gt;Senior Producer (temp)&lt;/strong&gt;, you will independently lead and oversee complex, high-volume digital production workstreams across global teams. You will manage the full lifecycle of campaign asset production—from briefing to delivery—while serving as the primary client-facing lead for one of our main tech clients. &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our ideal candidate is a fast, flexible go-getter who jumps on new opportunities and has a natural aptitude for collaboration.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Lead the execution of a high volume of mid-funnel and on-site assets, including static digital, DOOH, OOH, and OLVs, with the creative and production team at Monks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Establish project timelines, deliverables, and resource allocation to align with campaign goals and objectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Build and manage detailed project schedules, milestones, and budgets for timely and cost-effective delivery of creative assets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Partner closely with client teams to manage reviews, approvals, and brand compliance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Monitor progress, identify risks, and implement mitigation plans to keep projects on track.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Lead production efforts to ensure timely and expectations-exceeding delivery.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2349&quot; data-end=&quot;2425&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Bring in-house talent together and ensure high-quality work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Scope and quote projects, as well as plan production work with realistic targets and deadlines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Manage the end-to-end project life cycle from client briefing to delivery, ensuring operational clarity for all teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Proactively communicate updates on changing project priorities, timelines, and deliverables across teams. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Plan ahead and manage resources efficiently on a day-to-day and hour-to-hour basis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Act as a taskmaster, defining and communicating milestones across teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Provide quality control and review deliverables prepared by the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Manage asset trafficking and client feedback loops.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Track project changes and assess their impact on scope, cost, and timelines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Review project hours burn reports for accuracy and risks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Support strategies for risk mitigation and contingency planning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Ensure project documents are complete, current, and stored appropriately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Serve as the main lead client point-of-contact on all projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Account Management to escalate client issues and mitigate risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Provide guidance, training, and support to the creative team for their success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Ensure stakeholder satisfaction and evaluate project performance with the support of Account Management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;804&quot; data-end=&quot;826&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;804&quot; data-end=&quot;824&quot;&gt;Salary and Type:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;829&quot; data-end=&quot;908&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;829&quot; data-end=&quot;866&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;831&quot; data-end=&quot;866&quot;&gt;Annual salary: CAD 80,000–90,000&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;869&quot; data-end=&quot;908&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;871&quot; data-end=&quot;908&quot;&gt;Position type: Temporary, full-time schedule&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;869&quot; data-end=&quot;908&quot;&gt;Contract duration: through October 31, 2026, with the potential to convert to FTE based on performance and business needs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Monks, we believe in fostering an environment where a diversity of perspectives can thrive. We proactively work to design hiring processes that promote equity and inclusion while mitigating bias. We celebrate diversity and are committed to building a team that reflects the communities we serve. We welcome and encourage qualified applicants, from all backgrounds, who are excited to contribute to our mission.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Monks is committed to ensuring equal access and participation for people with disabilities. We are committed to treating people with disabilities in a way that allows them to maintain their dignity and independence. We believe in integration, and we are committed to meeting the needs of people with disabilities in a timely manner. We will do so by removing and preventing barriers to accessibility and by meeting our accessibility requirements under local accessibility laws.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-HYBIRD&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-ZZ1&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This role is subject to our Return to Office (RTO) policy. If you reside within a commutable distance of one of our office locations, you will be expected to work from the office a set number of days per week. The specific details, including the number of required office days, will be in accordance with the company’s then-current RTO policy, which is subject to change from time to time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Monks has provided a compensation range that represents its good faith estimate of what Monks may pay for the position at the time of posting. Monks may ultimately pay more or less than the posted compensation range. The salary offered to the selected candidate will be determined based on job-related factors, but not based on a candidate’s sex or any other protected status.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$80,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$90,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Monks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks is the global, digital-first, data-driven, unitary operating brand of S4 Capital plc. With a legacy of innovation and specialized expertise, Monks combines an extraordinary range of global Marketing and Technology Services to redefine how brands interact with the world. Through Monks.Flow, its flagship AI ecosystem for marketing orchestration, Monks transforms marketing into a growth engine, collapsing timelines and connecting brands to culture in real time. By deploying bespoke intelligent agents across disciplines and delivering culturally relevant, high-impact creative and digital solutions, Monks solves key critical business challenges across the entire brand enterprise to help brands sustain long-term impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks was named a Contender in The Forrester Wave™: Global Marketing Services, ranks among Cannes Lions&#39; Top 10 Creative Companies (2022-25) and remains the only partner featured in AdExchanger’s Programmatic Power Players list every year (2020-24). Named Adweek’s first AI Agency of the Year (2023) and The One Show’s inaugural AI Pioneer Organization, Monks was also awarded Business Intelligence Group’s 2025 Excellence in Artificial Intelligence Award in both the Organizational and AI Product categories. As a trusted partner to cutting-edge innovators in tech, Monks earned titles such as Optimizely Experimentation Partner of the Year (2025), runner-up for the Adobe Firefly Partner Award (2024), and Workato’s AI Visionary Customer Impact Award (2024). Additionally, Monks achieved a record-breaking number of FWAs and continues to hold the most of any partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to building a respectful and empowering work environment for all people to freely express themselves amongst colleagues who embrace diversity in all respects. Including fresh voices and unique points of view in all aspects of our business not only creates an environment where we can all grow and thrive but also increases our potential to produce work that better represents—and resonates with—the world around us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Please note that we will never request payment or bank account information at any stage of the recruitment process. As we continue to grow our teams, we urge you to be cautious of fraudulent job postings or recruitment activities that misuse our company name and information. Please protect your personal information during any recruitment process. While Monks may contact potential candidates via LinkedIn, all applications must be submitted through our official website (&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;monks.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced, detail-oriented, and hands-on Senior Producer (temp) to manage the end-to-end creation of bar-raising creative content for one of our major tech client&#39;s Global Studio team, in partnership with Monks. This hybrid role blends senior production, creative project management, and print production / traffic management into a single owner who brings creative work to life from briefing and intake through proofing, delivery, and retrospective.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with the Executive Producer, this person owns project timelines and budgets in execution, serves as a primary day-to-day contact for customers and internal teams, and is the key project driver across creative, production, vendor, and partner teams. The role spans cross-channel creative and carries responsibility for print mechanical proofing, color management, and final approvals with suppliers and vendors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond delivering individual projects, this person owns the one of the main workstreams end to end, not just executing the work, but building up the workstream itself and partnering with the client&#39;s team in an embedded capacity, which is precisely where identifying and creating new tools and new ways of working comes to life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Critically, this person is not only an excellent operator but an innovator: they are expected to create new ways of working and develop new tools, mechanisms, and solutions that raise the bar on how we deliver and ultimately best service our client&#39;s customer. The ideal candidate thrives in continuous planning and innovation, leads with confidence while respecting differing viewpoints, communicates expertly across all levels, and stays solutions-driven in the face of ambiguity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jjrgvq&quot; data-start=&quot;97&quot; data-end=&quot;245&quot;&gt;It&#39;s a&lt;strong data-start=&quot;107&quot; data-end=&quot;139&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;temporary assignment&lt;/strong&gt; with the potential for extension and future full-time conversion based on business needs and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1s837x3&quot; data-start=&quot;248&quot; data-end=&quot;371&quot;&gt;Open to candidates based in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;282&quot; data-end=&quot;300&quot;&gt;Canada or the U.S.&lt;/strong&gt;. Candidates must be available to work &lt;strong data-start=&quot;339&quot; data-end=&quot;370&quot;&gt;Pacific Time business hours&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pqpkx0&quot; data-start=&quot;374&quot; data-end=&quot;513&quot;&gt;Ability to travel approximately &lt;strong data-start=&quot;408&quot; data-end=&quot;433&quot;&gt;1–2 times per quarter&lt;/strong&gt; to the client&#39;s &lt;strong data-start=&quot;450&quot; data-end=&quot;482&quot;&gt;U.S. West Coast headquarters&lt;/strong&gt; and supplier/vendor locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production &amp;amp; Project Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Manage multiple parallel projects, partnering with designers, writers, business leaders, external agencies, and vendors, and act as the key project driver with internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Own the end-to-end process and mechanisms for content creation, defining prioritization criteria, schedules, stages and gates, and stakeholders&#39; roles and responsibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Support the creation of estimates, scoping, and project setup, then manage budgets and timelines through execution, ensuring milestones and dependencies are tracked and delivery stays on course.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Partner with creative and production teams to develop and execute the production plan and solutions, ensuring the team focuses on priority projects and understands the project vision, objectives, and requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Track production burn weekly, flagging risks to the Executive Producer and Global Studio team early, with proposed solutions and new paths to delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Identify scope changes and lead change orders or paths to savings, partnering commercially with the Executive Producer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Ensure project resources are fully utilized, raising awareness when gaps or free periods are identified.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Maintain the CST, asset trackers, and project documentation, keeping all data accurate, current, and reporting-ready, and provide clear project detail, data, and narratives for the P0 on each completed project.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Serve as the day-to-day customer contact and main point of contact between brand managers, agency partners, and internal stakeholders, building trusted relationships that extend beyond individual projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Translate customer needs into clear scopes and briefs, advising on key resource requirements, and partner with brand managers to understand campaign objectives, target audience, and brand guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Collect and synthesize input from stakeholders, share it out to the creative team, and communicate project status, changing priorities, timelines, and deliverables across teams, flagging and troubleshooting issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Create, maintain, and disseminate project information to stakeholders and senior management, providing regular updates that highlight milestones, achievements, and challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Remove roadblocks and disambiguate situations that impede designers and other contributors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Proactively set retrospective conversations with customers to invite open dialogue about ways of working, wins, and future improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Print Production, Traffic &amp;amp; Quality Control&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Act as point person for all brief intake and prioritization across resources, managing asset trackers and team tasks through completion of each campaign.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Manage the print production lifecycle from file preparation to final delivery, overseeing pre-press activities such as proofing, color management, and final approvals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Provide quality control and review of all deliverables before customer handoff, ensuring brand compliance and high-quality creative assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Monitor print production quality, troubleshoot issues as they arise, and draft specifications around materials, papers, inks, adhesives, print decoration, and finishing techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Provide on-site guidance and support with suppliers and vendors (quarterly travel required), and maintain an organized library of print assets and production records.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation &amp;amp; New Ways of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Create new ways of working: designing and improving processes, mechanisms, and standards that raise the bar and best service our client&#39;s customer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Identify, evaluate, and develop new tools, automations, and AI-enabled solutions that amplify creativity and efficiency across the production lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Apply the latest production tools to improve delivery, and champion their adoption across creative, production, and partner teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Uphold standards and best-practice methods while continuously seeking better, faster, and more cost-effective paths to delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 7+ years producing creative content, ideally with global brands, with proven experience managing budgets, timelines, and resourcing across multiple projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Strong understanding of cross-channel creative production across digital, static, and video; digital production experience required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Proven print production expertise — as a Print Production Specialist, Packaging Producer, Traffic Manager, or similar role — including the full print lifecycle, materials and finishing techniques, and the ability to draft specifications. Agency experience preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Extraordinary eye for color accuracy, quality standards, and brand compliance, with strong attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Experience as a client-facing lead, building relationships that extend beyond individual projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Demonstrated ability to create new ways of working and develop new tools, mechanisms, and AI/automation solutions in a production context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Excellent organization, communication, and interpersonal skills, with the ability to engage all levels of contributors and manage multiple competing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Proficiency in project management tools and software to track progress and timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Ability to work independently and proactively, taking ownership of projects and driving them to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Calm and effective under tight, changing deadlines, across teams and time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Ability to travel ~2x per quarter, both domestically and internationally, to on-site supplier and vendor locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Monks, we believe in fostering an environment where a diversity of perspectives can thrive. We proactively work to design hiring processes that promote equity and inclusion while mitigating bias. We celebrate diversity and are committed to building a team that reflects the communities we serve. We welcome and encourage qualified applicants, from all backgrounds, who are excited to contribute to our mission.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Monks is committed to ensuring equal access and participation for people with disabilities. We are committed to treating people with disabilities in a way that allows them to maintain their dignity and independence. We believe in integration, and we are committed to meeting the needs of people with disabilities in a timely manner. We will do so by removing and preventing barriers to accessibility and by meeting our accessibility requirements under local accessibility laws.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Monks has provided an hourly rate that represents its good faith estimate of what Monks may pay for the position at the time of posting. Monks may ultimately pay more or less than the posted compensation range. The rate offered to the selected candidate will be determined based on job-related factors, but not based on a candidate’s sex or any other protected status.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Hourly Rate&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$40&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$43 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Monks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks is the global, digital-first, data-driven, unitary operating brand of S4 Capital plc. With a legacy of innovation and specialized expertise, Monks combines an extraordinary range of global Marketing and Technology Services to redefine how brands interact with the world. Through Monks.Flow, its flagship AI ecosystem for marketing orchestration, Monks transforms marketing into a growth engine, collapsing timelines and connecting brands to culture in real time. By deploying bespoke intelligent agents across disciplines and delivering culturally relevant, high-impact creative and digital solutions, Monks solves key critical business challenges across the entire brand enterprise to help brands sustain long-term impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks was named a Contender in The Forrester Wave™: Global Marketing Services, ranks among Cannes Lions&#39; Top 10 Creative Companies (2022-25) and remains the only partner featured in AdExchanger’s Programmatic Power Players list every year (2020-24). Named Adweek’s first AI Agency of the Year (2023) and The One Show’s inaugural AI Pioneer Organization, Monks was also awarded Business Intelligence Group’s 2025 Excellence in Artificial Intelligence Award in both the Organizational and AI Product categories. As a trusted partner to cutting-edge innovators in tech, Monks earned titles such as Optimizely Experimentation Partner of the Year (2025), runner-up for the Adobe Firefly Partner Award (2024), and Workato’s AI Visionary Customer Impact Award (2024). Additionally, Monks achieved a record-breaking number of FWAs and continues to hold the most of any partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to building a respectful and empowering work environment for all people to freely express themselves amongst colleagues who embrace diversity in all respects. Including fresh voices and unique points of view in all aspects of our business not only creates an environment where we can all grow and thrive but also increases our potential to produce work that better represents—and resonates with—the world around us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Please note that we will never request payment or bank account information at any stage of the recruitment process. As we continue to grow our teams, we urge you to be cautious of fraudulent job postings or recruitment activities that misuse our company name and information. Please protect your personal information during any recruitment process. While Monks may contact potential candidates via LinkedIn, all applications must be submitted through our official website (&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;monks.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced, detail-oriented, and hands-on Senior Producer (temp) to manage the end-to-end creation of bar-raising creative content for one of our major tech client&#39;s Global Studio team, in partnership with Monks. This hybrid role blends senior production, creative project management, and print production / traffic management into a single owner who brings creative work to life from briefing and intake through proofing, delivery, and retrospective.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with the Executive Producer, this person owns project timelines and budgets in execution, serves as a primary day-to-day contact for customers and internal teams, and is the key project driver across creative, production, vendor, and partner teams. The role spans cross-channel creative and carries responsibility for print mechanical proofing, color management, and final approvals with suppliers and vendors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond delivering individual projects, this person owns the one of the main workstreams end to end, not just executing the work, but building up the workstream itself and partnering with the client&#39;s team in an embedded capacity, which is precisely where identifying and creating new tools and new ways of working comes to life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Critically, this person is not only an excellent operator but an innovator: they are expected to create new ways of working and develop new tools, mechanisms, and solutions that raise the bar on how we deliver and ultimately best service our client&#39;s customer. The ideal candidate thrives in continuous planning and innovation, leads with confidence while respecting differing viewpoints, communicates expertly across all levels, and stays solutions-driven in the face of ambiguity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jjrgvq&quot; data-start=&quot;97&quot; data-end=&quot;245&quot;&gt;It&#39;s a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;107&quot; data-end=&quot;139&quot;&gt;temporary assignment&lt;/strong&gt; with the potential for extension and future full-time conversion based on business needs and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1s837x3&quot; data-start=&quot;248&quot; data-end=&quot;371&quot;&gt;Open to candidates based in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;282&quot; data-end=&quot;300&quot;&gt;Canada or the U.S.&lt;/strong&gt;. Candidates must be available to work &lt;strong data-start=&quot;339&quot; data-end=&quot;370&quot;&gt;Pacific Time business hours&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pqpkx0&quot; data-start=&quot;374&quot; data-end=&quot;513&quot;&gt;Ability to travel approximately &lt;strong data-start=&quot;408&quot; data-end=&quot;433&quot;&gt;1–2 times per quarter&lt;/strong&gt; to the client&#39;s &lt;strong data-start=&quot;450&quot; data-end=&quot;482&quot;&gt;U.S. West Coast headquarters&lt;/strong&gt; and supplier/vendor locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production &amp;amp; Project Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Manage multiple parallel projects, partnering with designers, writers, business leaders, external agencies, and vendors, and act as the key project driver with internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Own the end-to-end process and mechanisms for content creation, defining prioritization criteria, schedules, stages and gates, and stakeholders&#39; roles and responsibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Support the creation of estimates, scoping, and project setup, then manage budgets and timelines through execution, ensuring milestones and dependencies are tracked and delivery stays on course.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Partner with creative and production teams to develop and execute the production plan and solutions, ensuring the team focuses on priority projects and understands the project vision, objectives, and requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Track production burn weekly, flagging risks to the Executive Producer and Global Studio team early, with proposed solutions and new paths to delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Identify scope changes and lead change orders or paths to savings, partnering commercially with the Executive Producer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Ensure project resources are fully utilized, raising awareness when gaps or free periods are identified.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Maintain the CST, asset trackers, and project documentation, keeping all data accurate, current, and reporting-ready, and provide clear project detail, data, and narratives for the P0 on each completed project.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Serve as the day-to-day customer contact and main point of contact between brand managers, agency partners, and internal stakeholders, building trusted relationships that extend beyond individual projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Translate customer needs into clear scopes and briefs, advising on key resource requirements, and partner with brand managers to understand campaign objectives, target audience, and brand guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Collect and synthesize input from stakeholders, share it out to the creative team, and communicate project status, changing priorities, timelines, and deliverables across teams, flagging and troubleshooting issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Create, maintain, and disseminate project information to stakeholders and senior management, providing regular updates that highlight milestones, achievements, and challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Remove roadblocks and disambiguate situations that impede designers and other contributors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Proactively set retrospective conversations with customers to invite open dialogue about ways of working, wins, and future improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Print Production, Traffic &amp;amp; Quality Control&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Act as point person for all brief intake and prioritization across resources, managing asset trackers and team tasks through completion of each campaign.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Manage the print production lifecycle from file preparation to final delivery, overseeing pre-press activities such as proofing, color management, and final approvals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Provide quality control and review of all deliverables before customer handoff, ensuring brand compliance and high-quality creative assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Monitor print production quality, troubleshoot issues as they arise, and draft specifications around materials, papers, inks, adhesives, print decoration, and finishing techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Provide on-site guidance and support with suppliers and vendors (quarterly travel required), and maintain an organized library of print assets and production records.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation &amp;amp; New Ways of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Create new ways of working: designing and improving processes, mechanisms, and standards that raise the bar and best service our client&#39;s customer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Identify, evaluate, and develop new tools, automations, and AI-enabled solutions that amplify creativity and efficiency across the production lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Apply the latest production tools to improve delivery, and champion their adoption across creative, production, and partner teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Uphold standards and best-practice methods while continuously seeking better, faster, and more cost-effective paths to delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 7+ years producing creative content, ideally with global brands, with proven experience managing budgets, timelines, and resourcing across multiple projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Strong understanding of cross-channel creative production across digital, static, and video; digital production experience required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Proven print production expertise — as a Print Production Specialist, Packaging Producer, Traffic Manager, or similar role — including the full print lifecycle, materials and finishing techniques, and the ability to draft specifications. Agency experience preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Extraordinary eye for color accuracy, quality standards, and brand compliance, with strong attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Experience as a client-facing lead, building relationships that extend beyond individual projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Demonstrated ability to create new ways of working and develop new tools, mechanisms, and AI/automation solutions in a production context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Excellent organization, communication, and interpersonal skills, with the ability to engage all levels of contributors and manage multiple competing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Proficiency in project management tools and software to track progress and timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Ability to work independently and proactively, taking ownership of projects and driving them to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Calm and effective under tight, changing deadlines, across teams and time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Ability to travel ~2x per quarter, both domestically and internationally, to on-site supplier and vendor locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
