&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Designer, you will lead the development of innovative digital ads and assets for one of the world&#39;s largest packaged goods companies. This role demands expertise in balancing speed, style, and scale to produce high-quality visual content that resonates across multiple platforms. We are looking for someone passionate about seeking new opportunities, contributing to a nimble, AI-forward team, and creating impactful work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the creation of style proposals, concept mockups, and prototypes to initiate design projects for products, features, and campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams, including marketing and production, to ensure designs meet client expectations and adhere to brand guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute and enhance art direction while providing innovative ideas and best practices to improve the creative process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex creative briefs into actionable and thorough design briefs that inform the design process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure pixel-perfect execution of designs, maintaining quality and attention to detail at all times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Specialise in crafting interactive assets for social media and other digital channels.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be capable of creating designs and technical setup for typical POS print media.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay informed about cultural trends and incorporate insights into designs to ensure relevance and appeal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate storytelling through design by skillfully combining aesthetics with functionality in visual content and motion graphics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and support junior designers, providing guidance and feedback to foster skill development within the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multiple projects simultaneously, prioritising tasks to meet deadlines and deliver high-quality work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The essentials:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience as a Designer, ideally in a digital or advertising environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in especially Figma and also Adobe Creative Suite, particularly Photoshop, Illustrator, and InDesign. After Effects is a bonus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong portfolio showcasing expertise in digital design and advertising materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience with all stages of the design process, from concept development to final execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of design fundamentals, including typography, grid systems, interaction design, and storytelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills for effectively collaborating with clients and team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a fast-paced environment and adapt to changing project needs and priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with creating print-ready files for POS in Indesign/Illustrator.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with current social media trends and best practices for visual content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest and borderline obsession with evolving AI and automation technology and functionality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to guide and encourage younger design team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
