&lt;li&gt;Experience leading discovery sessions, prioritization workshops, and requirements elicitation workshops&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to quickly ramp up on new business domains and translate business, user, and technical needs into product direction&lt;/li&gt;
