&lt;li&gt;Ability to pitch and clearly articulate product value to different audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using agile development methodologies with globally distributed teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Figma, Miro, or other modern collaborative design tools to create or modify wireframes and designs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Jira or other requirements management tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Goal-oriented, autonomous, organized, and comfortable working both independently and collaboratively with minimal supervision&lt;/li&gt;
