&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;We are seeking a heavyweight Senior Project Manager for an immediate, high-visibility temporary-to-permanent role. In this position, you will own the end-to-end execution of work for one of our largest and most matrixed CPG accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;This isn&#39;t a role for a passive note-taker; we need a strategic operator who can step into an active ecosystem, gain immediate credibility with senior stakeholders, and keep multi-million dollar cross-functional initiatives on time and on budget. Because this is a contract-to-hire position, we are looking for someone who treats this from day one as a long-term home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Own the Account&#39;s Engine:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the planning, scoping, and execution of complex, multi-tier CPG initiatives spanning product launches, integrated marketing campaigns, packaging updates, and digital activations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Manage Enterprise Stakeholders:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the central hub connecting client brand managers, creative teams, supply chain partners, and external vendors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Scope &amp;amp; Resource Forecasting:&lt;/strong&gt; Build precise project roadmaps, manage complex budgets, allocate internal resources, and proactively mitigate risks before they hit the timeline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Process Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Evaluate existing workflows and implement agile or hybrid methodologies to streamline delivery for this fast-moving account.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot;&gt;ABOUT YOU&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate lives at the intersection of rigid organizational mastery and fluid relationship management. CPG accounts are notoriously fast-moving and subject to supply chain or retail shifts—you must be someone who stays calm in the chaos.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;22&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;17,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;5+ years of Project Management experience&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally split between a fast-paced agency environment and enterprise corporate accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;17,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Deep CPG Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; You must speak the language of consumer goods (retail timelines, cross-functional brand matrixes, packaging regulations, and multi-channel campaign rollouts).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;17,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Must be based in or willing to commute to the &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;56&quot;&gt;Minneapolis&lt;/strong&gt; area to align with client and team touchpoints.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;17,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Tool Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced proficiency with enterprise PM tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Monks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
