&lt;li data-start=&quot;1246&quot; data-end=&quot;1546&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1246&quot; data-end=&quot;1268&quot;&gt;Client Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; You partner with Client Directors and cross-functional teams on proactive initiatives and new business opportunities. You&#39;re comfortable presenting to senior marketing and product stakeholders, facilitating strategic discussions, and confidently defending your recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
