&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The essentials:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;285&quot; data-end=&quot;477&quot;&gt;10+ years of experience in Digital Strategy, UX Strategy, Experience Strategy, or a closely related discipline, with significant experience leading strategy for enterprise digital experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;479&quot; data-end=&quot;802&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;479&quot; data-end=&quot;494&quot;&gt;Agency DNA:&lt;/strong&gt; You have built your career in a digital, creative, or integrated agency environment where websites and digital ecosystems are treated as core marketing channels. You understand how campaigns, content strategy, customer journeys, and brand storytelling come together to create meaningful digital experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;804&quot; data-end=&quot;1058&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;804&quot; data-end=&quot;830&quot;&gt;Enterprise Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ve developed strategy for large-scale websites or digital ecosystems serving global brands. You&#39;re comfortable navigating complex information architectures, multiple stakeholder groups, and interconnected customer journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1060&quot; data-end=&quot;1370&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1060&quot; data-end=&quot;1092&quot;&gt;Proven Strategic Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; You have significant ownership of strategic thinking—from shaping recommendations and authoring strategy decks to presenting confidently to senior client stakeholders. You&#39;re comfortable leading conversations, influencing decisions, and building trust with executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
