&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Work&lt;/strong&gt; with generalists to create 3D art and bring it into the engine&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Support&lt;/strong&gt; artists in using the 3D art pipeline and user-facing engine tools&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
