&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Provide&lt;/strong&gt; hands-on guidance on asset performance, optimization, and validation&lt;/p&gt;
