&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Visual Quality Assurance, you’ll play a crucial part in upholding our visual standards, ensuring every design deliverable meets brand guidelines and technical excellence before release. Your keen eye for detail and collaborative spirit ensure our work is pixel-perfect, and functional across every channel and device. We are looking for someone who is passionate about seeking new opportunities to elevate the quality and consistency of our creative output.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and QA designs, animations, and edits for pixel perfect execution, consistency, copy accuracy, and adherence to strict branding and platform specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide detailed, constructive feedback to creative teams, acting as the final checkpoint before public release.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test user interactions, verifying pixel-perfect execution and seamless functionality across all devices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use Jira, Confluence and other project management tools to document, track, and report bugs or visual inconsistencies, and ensure timely resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously refine and integrate QA processes within the wider production workflow, identifying opportunities to boost efficiency and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate, insightful QA documentation (including spreadsheets and visual reports) to track trends and guide improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with producers, designers, and developers to ensure the highest creative standards are met in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The essentials:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;+5 years of hands-on Visual QA experience, ideally within a creative, marketing, or advertising environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong eye for design, composition, pace and detail, with working proficiency in Photoshop or comparable design tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of video and sound specifications, with basic working proficiency in Premiere or comparable video editing software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience and a strong understanding of mechanical files from print, in store and OOH asset requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of digital media specs and cross-device requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organization and prioritization skills—able to manage multiple projects while maintaining high standards of accuracy and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communicator, adept at providing thorough and actionable feedback to creative and production teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conversant with QA and production tracking tools, particularly Jira and Excel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Positive, solutions-oriented mindset with a natural drive for continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in a marketing or advertising environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Not a Must but a Plus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge and interest in learning about generative agentic AI, automation processes and tech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
