&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Visual QA&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll play a critical role in ensuring every creative asset we produce meets the highest standards of visual quality, technical accuracy, and brand consistency before it reaches the public. You&#39;ll serve as the final quality checkpoint across a wide range of deliverables, including static, animated, video, print, digital, and social assets, helping safeguard the quality of work delivered for large-scale global marketing campaigns.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond executing QA, you&#39;ll contribute to continuously improving QA processes, establishing best practices, and collaborating with cross-functional teams to build an efficient, scalable quality assurance workflow. We are looking for someone with an exceptional eye for detail, strong ownership, and a passion for raising the bar for creative excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform manual visual QA of creative assets across digital and print channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review creative work for pixel-perfect execution, visual consistency, copy accuracy, branding compliance, and adherence to technical and platform specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verify that layouts, responsive behavior, and visual presentation render correctly across different browsers, devices, and environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the final quality gate before delivery, ensuring assets are accurate, polished, and ready for launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, document, and communicate visual defects and inconsistencies using project management and QA tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with project managers, designers, developers, producers, and other stakeholders to resolve issues efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to improving QA processes, documentation, and best practices to enhance quality and team efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help promote consistent production standards, version control, and quality awareness across project teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The essentials:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5+ years of hands-on Visual QA experience within a creative agency, marketing, advertising, production, or digital environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional attention to detail with the ability to quickly identify visual, technical, and copy-related issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of design principles, typography, layout, color, composition, branding, accessibility, and digital production standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience reviewing creative assets across multiple browsers and devices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Adobe Photoshop or similar design tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with project management, collaboration, and documentation tools such as Jira, Confluence, and Google Workspace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organisational and prioritisation skills, with the ability to manage multiple projects in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills with the ability to provide clear, constructive, and actionable feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, proactive, and solutions-oriented mindset with a passion for continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Not a must, but a plus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on large-scale, global marketing programs with high-volume creative production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of AI-assisted creative workflows, automation, and emerging production technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring junior QA team members or helping establish QA standards and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
