&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Location: &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;Hybrid, Bogotá, Colombia.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_ebe5e11f1c9a1df9-22&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;.Monks Marketing Services, &lt;span class=&quot;citation-79 citation-end-79&quot;&gt;part of Media.Monks and S4 Capital, is a global consulting firm mastering AI-powered transformations for the Fortune 100. We combine long-term strategic thinking, deep enterprise experience, and a human-centered approach to help clients transform business processes and dominate their indu&lt;/span&gt;stries.&lt;/p&gt;
