&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-Time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience Level:&lt;/strong&gt; Senior&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry:&lt;/strong&gt; Technology, Digital Marketing, Web Development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About .Monks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks is the industry’s Agentic Transformation Partner, architecting the future of real-time brands. As a global marketing and technology services company, we go beyond traditional boundaries to design and operate Agentic Operating Systems that help brands innovate, organize, and operate at the speed of culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Monks, we value T-shaped talent—people with deep craft mastery and a horizontal fluency in AI that allows them to collaborate across disciplines and deliver outcomes. With a global team of nearly 6,000 digital experts across 33 countries, you&#39;ll find a diverse group of colleagues with different backgrounds and perspectives. We believe everyone has something of value to offer, and that sustaining a truly diverse, equitable and inclusive workplace begins with fostering an environment where people can be themselves, authentically, every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a highly skilled &lt;strong&gt;Full-Stack Developer&lt;/strong&gt; to drive the evolution of our proprietary central orchestration platform. In this role, you will bridge the gap between practical user experience and powerful server-side logic, helping us scale the internal tooling that enables our teams to operate more effectively and competitively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate has a keen eye for UI execution, a proven &quot;feel&quot; for UX, and strong engineering fundamentals. You will translate complex management requirements into user-friendly, responsive interfaces while building high-performance APIs, robust bi-directional integrations, and automated workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Frontend Architecture &amp;amp; UI Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, implement, and maintain robust, responsive, and intuitive web applications using &lt;strong&gt;ReactJS&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;TypeScript&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize Material Design libraries (&lt;strong&gt;MUI&lt;/strong&gt;) to build a consistent, professional, and highly functional internal toolkit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and manage scalable design systems to ensure consistency across internal tooling projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize frontend performance and scalability, ensuring the interface remains 100% stable, intuitive, and high-performing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Backend Engineering &amp;amp; System Integration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain robust server-side logic (utilizing &lt;strong&gt;PHP/Symfony&lt;/strong&gt; as our core platform language), ensuring high performance, responsiveness, and reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, implement, and document secure RESTful APIs and Web Services that adhere to industry standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain complex, bi-directional data syncs across our enterprise stack (including Salesforce, NetSuite, Workday, and other custom internal tooling) to secure &quot;One Source of Truth&quot; across project data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with database systems, driving setup, maintenance, query optimization, and structuring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Evolution &amp;amp; Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve core platform features to meet adapting business needs, including time-tracking modules, timesheet approval workflows, and advanced data validation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate AI-driven features like &lt;strong&gt;agentic workflows&lt;/strong&gt; to automate internal processes and scale operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on reducing &quot;gap time friction&quot; and automating manual workflows to accelerate business velocity and eliminate operational bottlenecks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Debug, troubleshoot, and resolve complex full-stack issues, bottlenecks, and performance bugs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical guidance, documentation, and support to the wider Monk community on the platform’s capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 3-5+ years of professional full-stack web development experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Frontend Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong proficiency in &lt;strong&gt;ReactJS&lt;/strong&gt;, with a solid foundation in &lt;strong&gt;TypeScript&lt;/strong&gt;, JavaScript (ES6+), HTML5, and CSS3. Strong understanding of responsive design and cross-browser compatibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Backend Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong backend development background. Experience with &lt;strong&gt;PHP&lt;/strong&gt; and MVC frameworks (such as &lt;strong&gt;Symfony&lt;/strong&gt;) is highly preferred; however, we are fully open to strong engineers from other language ecosystems who are willing to quickly adapt, leveraging AI-assisted coding and development tools to bridge any syntax gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integration &amp;amp; APIs:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience in REST API design, Web Services, and integrating third-party APIs (including authentication protocols like OAuth).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud &amp;amp; DevOps:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with modern cloud platforms (AWS, GCP, or Azure) and containerization/virtualization tools (e.g., Docker).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curiosity-First Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; You don’t wait for a manual; you play, break things, and ask &quot;What if?&quot; to adopt new tools and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience working effectively in agile development environments (Scrum/Kanban). Excellent communication and alignment skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent communication skills in English, both written and verbal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Frontend Tooling:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with modern frontend build tools and UI frameworks/libraries (e.g., TailwindCSS, Styled Components, Material UI, Vite).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Testing:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with full-stack testing practices and frameworks (e.g., Vitest, Jest, Playwright).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Databases:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency with database technologies such as SQL Server, PostgreSQL, or NoSQL databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CI/CD &amp;amp; Infrastructure:&lt;/strong&gt; Knowledge of DevOps practices, Git version control, and CI/CD pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong understanding of security principles and best practices in web application development (OWASP, data privacy, secure authentication).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ERP and CRM integrations, specifically &lt;strong&gt;NetSuite&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Salesforce&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with design tools such as &lt;strong&gt;Figma&lt;/strong&gt; to facilitate developer-to-designer handoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with container orchestration tools like Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience or secondary proficiency in other programming languages (e.g., Node.js, Python).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid &lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;#LI-AS1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Monks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks is the global, digital-first, data-driven, unitary operating brand of S4 Capital plc. With a legacy of innovation and specialized expertise, Monks combines an extraordinary range of global Marketing and Technology Services to redefine how brands interact with the world. Through Monks.Flow, its flagship AI ecosystem for marketing orchestration, Monks transforms marketing into a growth engine, collapsing timelines and connecting brands to culture in real time. By deploying bespoke intelligent agents across disciplines and delivering culturally relevant, high-impact creative and digital solutions, Monks solves key critical business challenges across the entire brand enterprise to help brands sustain long-term impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks was named a Contender in The Forrester Wave™: Global Marketing Services, ranks among Cannes Lions&#39; Top 10 Creative Companies (2022-25) and remains the only partner featured in AdExchanger’s Programmatic Power Players list every year (2020-24). Named Adweek’s first AI Agency of the Year (2023) and The One Show’s inaugural AI Pioneer Organization, Monks was also awarded Business Intelligence Group’s 2025 Excellence in Artificial Intelligence Award in both the Organizational and AI Product categories. As a trusted partner to cutting-edge innovators in tech, Monks earned titles such as Optimizely Experimentation Partner of the Year (2025), runner-up for the Adobe Firefly Partner Award (2024), and Workato’s AI Visionary Customer Impact Award (2024). Additionally, Monks achieved a record-breaking number of FWAs and continues to hold the most of any partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to building a respectful and empowering work environment for all people to freely express themselves amongst colleagues who embrace diversity in all respects. Including fresh voices and unique points of view in all aspects of our business not only creates an environment where we can all grow and thrive but also increases our potential to produce work that better represents—and resonates with—the world around us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Please note that we will never request payment or bank account information at any stage of the recruitment process. As we continue to grow our teams, we urge you to be cautious of fraudulent job postings or recruitment activities that misuse our company name and information. Please protect your personal information during any recruitment process. While Monks may contact potential candidates via LinkedIn, all applications must be submitted through our official website (&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;monks.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Production Designer, you will contribute to the technical execution and scaling of innovative digital ads and assets for one of the world&#39;s largest packaged goods companies. This role demands expertise in balancing efficiency, speed, precision, and scale to produce high-quality visual content that resonates across multiple platforms. We are looking for someone passionate about seeking new solutions to production challenges, contributing to an AI-forward team, and creating impactful work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the technical execution, versioning, and rollout of design projects for products, features, and campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams, including marketing and production, to ensure designs meet client expectations and adhere to brand guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute master creatives across various formats while providing innovative ideas and best practices to improve the design pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex creative briefs into actionable and thorough production workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure pixel-perfect execution of designs, maintaining quality and attention to detail at all times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Specialise in crafting and adapting interactive assets for social media and other digital channels, with best practices of each platform as a north star.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be capable of creating designs and precise technical setups for typical POS print media.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain robust templates, style guides, and asset libraries to ensure consistency and efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and support junior designers, providing guidance and feedback to foster skill development within the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multiple projects simultaneously, prioritising tasks to meet deadlines and deliver high-quality work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Essentials&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience as a Production Designer or similar role, ideally in a digital or advertising environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in Adobe Creative Suite, particularly Figma and InDesign, as well as Illustrator, and Photoshop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong portfolio showcasing expertise in digital production, asset adaptation, and advertising materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience with the execution stages of the design process, from master asset handover to final delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of design fundamentals, including typography, grid systems, layout, and pre-press standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills for effectively collaborating with clients and team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a fast-paced environment and adapt to changing project needs and priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with creating print-ready files for POS in Indesign/Illustrator.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with current social media specs and best practices for visual content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest and borderline obsession with evolving AI and automation technology and functionality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to guide and encourage younger design team members, oversee their work and provide constructive feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Not a Must but a Plus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some basic knowledge of front-end development (HTML/CSS) is a bonus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of and experience in UX/UI is a bonus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with automated versioning tools or scripting to scale production workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with generative or agentic AI tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
