&lt;p&gt;As a Director of Strategy you&#39;ll be instrumental in shaping and executing Google Ads advertising growth initiatives. This role demands a unique blend of strategic foresight to identify opportunities,and robust program management skillset to translate those strategies into impactful, high-performing marketing campaigns from concept to post-launch optimization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Product Marketing Managers in the strategic planning and end-to-end execution of marketing campaigns, focusing on driving product adoptions and program revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape experiment designs and workflows in collaboration with Product Marketing Managers, analytics and product POCs, ensuring tests are robust and insights are actionable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive global scalability initiatives for campaigns, identifying workflow efficiencies and optimizing documentation for broader impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development of key campaigns and identifying opportunities to tailor messaging and integrate thought leadership for incremental revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply strategic optimizations including the application of Generative AI (GenAI) images to enhance campaign effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion efforts to increase marketing contactability rates, by monitoring quarterly opt-in email campaigns, monitoring performance, and exploring additional opt-in levers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the strategic direction and execution of marketing campaigns, leveraging seasonal events to drive share of wallet through personalized messaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the full campaign lifecycle, from initial creative development and legal approvals through to launch, ensuring consistency, correct personalization, and accurate test/control assignments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee project lifecycle activities, including creating milestone planners, developing RACI matrices, managing approval processes, and performing proactive risk management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare executive program communications detailing launch information, initial adoption, and engagement rates, providing clear updates to stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive facilitates cross-functional collaboration with Product Marketing Managers, Product Managers, Data teams, Engineering, Production, Data Scientists, MTO, and other product leads to ensure unified campaign efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary liaison for production teams, addressing questions and ensuring send counts align with data provided by analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with legal and local counsel to ensure campaign compliance and meet localization requirements across various countries and regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
