&lt;li&gt;Ensure process compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement new and innovative ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage conflicting situations and act as a facilitator of solutions for the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate the projects that are generated inter-vertically.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being an ambassador of the Media.Monks culture for all stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know the strengths and weaknesses of the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know how to delegate and trust the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the implementation, maintenance, and communication of Information Security controls and activities in line with the policies and procedures defined and aligned with the Information Security strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of profiles and processes of the different specialties within the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assure that candidates receive an excellent experience in all their processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make sure that diversity and inclusion are part of all our processes.&lt;/li&gt;
