&lt;li&gt;2+ years leading or supervising recruitment teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional training: agile methodologies, different recruitment software, interview strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Agile Talent Acquisition and usage of recruitment tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in people development (plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in agile environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic vision: the ability to understand the needs of the business and act in accordance with the well-being of the company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
