&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate with clients: ability to generate bonds of trust with our stakeholders based on the quality of our work. Ability to maintain fluid, dynamic and strategic communication with them.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to interact with different working cultures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in translating business objectives into concrete action plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing and prioritizing multiple searches, projects and client relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent criteria in time management and in determining priorities, with little direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;People Management: Ability to generate empathy and harmony with teams and people&#39;s needs. Consultative approach, offering scalable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial spirit, with initiative and the ability to create networks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
