&lt;li&gt;Concepts: RAG, Agents, Agentic AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile processes certification (Scrum Master or Product Owner).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring and team building.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
