&lt;p&gt;As a Technical Project Manager, you&#39;ll be the driving force behind our platform-based projects and high-volume digital asset deployments. We are looking for a Mid to Senior-level professional with 4-5 years of experience who can hit the ground running from day one.&amp;nbsp;You will bridge the gap between technical execution and high-frequency asset delivery, driving the templatisation of assets to enable automated production and ensuring every single output is flawless at a massive scale. If you are highly organised, analytical, and know how to keep complex technical workflows moving seamlessly, this is the role for you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-Format Production &amp;amp; Automation Scoping:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead diverse asset production projects spanning social, digital, and e-commerce platforms. Continuously evaluate these production lifecycles to proactively recognise, scope, and implement new opportunities for automation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation &amp;amp; Storefront Library Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the templatisation of digital assets to transition manual workflows into automated production. Act as the digital &quot;librarian&quot; for our storefront ecosystem, organising, maintaining, and auditing the template repository to ensure all automated assets are scalable, accurate, and easily accessible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Communication Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain exceptional verbal and written communication with client teams and external partners. Serve as a trusted, proactive communicator who can translate complex technical workflows, automated processes, and project statuses into clear, actionable updates.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Team Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate across internal teams, client teams, and our Data Insights team to keep complex production workflows perfectly aligned.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay ahead of the curve by keeping up with new digital tools, platform updates, and industry best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The essentials:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven 4-5 years of experience/background managing asset production with a strong technical mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Seeker:&lt;/strong&gt; You instinctively spot production efficiencies to drive asset templatisation and automated workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organisation &amp;amp; Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptionally organised, detail-oriented, and able to manage time efficiently under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong verbal and written communication skills with a natural ability to influence and collaborate with internal teams and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; A self-motivated team player with a positive, high-energy attitude and a strong sense of ownership over your work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
