&lt;p data-start=&quot;280&quot; data-end=&quot;534&quot;&gt;At Monks, we’re always excited to connect with professionals who want to make an impact at the intersection of technology and business. This posting is part of our effort to meet exceptional candidates for &lt;strong data-start=&quot;486&quot; data-end=&quot;531&quot;&gt;future Technical Project Manager openings&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;536&quot; data-end=&quot;856&quot;&gt;In this role, you’ll be key to ensuring software projects are delivered successfully, aligning execution with business objectives and driving both technical and commercial excellence. You’ll bring structure to complexity, proactively manage risks, and make sure delivery outcomes stay on track — on time and on budget.&lt;/p&gt;
