&lt;li data-start=&quot;926&quot; data-end=&quot;988&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;928&quot; data-end=&quot;988&quot;&gt;Develop detailed project plans, timelines, and milestones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;989&quot; data-end=&quot;1067&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;991&quot; data-end=&quot;1067&quot;&gt;Coordinate communication, documentation, and task management across teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1068&quot; data-end=&quot;1145&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1070&quot; data-end=&quot;1145&quot;&gt;Ensure backlog, tickets, and release plans remain current and actionable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1147&quot; data-end=&quot;1181&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1147&quot; data-end=&quot;1179&quot;&gt;Risk &amp;amp; Dependency Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1182&quot; data-end=&quot;1400&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1182&quot; data-end=&quot;1250&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1184&quot; data-end=&quot;1250&quot;&gt;Identify, track, and mitigate risks, dependencies, and blockers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1251&quot; data-end=&quot;1316&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1253&quot; data-end=&quot;1316&quot;&gt;Develop contingency plans and escalate critical issues early.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1317&quot; data-end=&quot;1400&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1319&quot; data-end=&quot;1400&quot;&gt;Provide risk assessments and trade-off scenarios to guide leadership decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1402&quot; data-end=&quot;1433&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1402&quot; data-end=&quot;1431&quot;&gt;Stakeholder Communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1434&quot; data-end=&quot;1630&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1434&quot; data-end=&quot;1539&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1436&quot; data-end=&quot;1539&quot;&gt;Maintain clear and consistent communication with product, engineering, QA, and external stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
