&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1739&quot; data-end=&quot;1816&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1741&quot; data-end=&quot;1816&quot;&gt;Support invoicing accuracy and ensure alignment with delivery milestones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1817&quot; data-end=&quot;1904&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1819&quot; data-end=&quot;1904&quot;&gt;Monitor financial health of projects and recommend corrective actions where needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1906&quot; data-end=&quot;1940&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1906&quot; data-end=&quot;1938&quot;&gt;Change &amp;amp; Resource Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1941&quot; data-end=&quot;2099&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1941&quot; data-end=&quot;2002&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1943&quot; data-end=&quot;2002&quot;&gt;Manage scope changes while protecting core project goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2003&quot; data-end=&quot;2099&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2005&quot; data-end=&quot;2099&quot;&gt;Balance competing priorities and allocate resources effectively in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
