&lt;li data-start=&quot;2127&quot; data-end=&quot;2222&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2129&quot; data-end=&quot;2222&quot;&gt;Proven experience managing cross-functional technical projects from initiation to delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2223&quot; data-end=&quot;2286&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2225&quot; data-end=&quot;2286&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of Agile, Scrum, or Kanban lifecycles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2287&quot; data-end=&quot;2377&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2289&quot; data-end=&quot;2377&quot;&gt;Proficiency with project management tools (e.g., Jira, Confluence, Asana, Smartsheet).&lt;/p&gt;
