&lt;li data-start=&quot;2465&quot; data-end=&quot;2577&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2467&quot; data-end=&quot;2577&quot;&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, able to adapt across technical and business stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2578&quot; data-end=&quot;2609&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2580&quot; data-end=&quot;2609&quot;&gt;English level: B2+ minimum.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
