&lt;p&gt;At its core, Monks is designed to help brands navigate the &quot;always-on&quot; digital world through a philosophy of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&quot;&lt;/strong&gt;unitary structure&lt;strong&gt;&quot;&lt;/strong&gt;—meaning no silos, no borders, and a relentless focus on speed, quality, and value.&lt;/p&gt;
