&lt;p&gt;Monks was named a Contender in The Forrester Wave™: Global Marketing Services, ranks among Cannes Lions&#39; Top 10 Creative Companies (2022-25) and remains the only partner featured in AdExchanger’s Programmatic Power Players list every year (2020-24). Named Adweek’s first AI Agency of the Year (2023) and The One Show’s inaugural AI Pioneer Organization, Monks was also awarded Business Intelligence Group’s 2025 Excellence in Artificial Intelligence Award in both the Organizational and AI Product categories. As a trusted partner to cutting-edge innovators in tech, Monks earned titles such as Optimizely Experimentation Partner of the Year (2025), runner-up for the Adobe Firefly Partner Award (2024), and Workato’s AI Visionary Customer Impact Award (2024). Additionally, Monks achieved a record-breaking number of FWAs and continues to hold the most of any partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to building a respectful and empowering work environment for all people to freely express themselves amongst colleagues who embrace diversity in all respects. Including fresh voices and unique points of view in all aspects of our business not only creates an environment where we can all grow and thrive but also increases our potential to produce work that better represents—and resonates with—the world around us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Please note that we will never request payment or bank account information at any stage of the recruitment process. As we continue to grow our teams, we urge you to be cautious of fraudulent job postings or recruitment activities that misuse our company name and information. Please protect your personal information during any recruitment process. While Monks may contact potential candidates via LinkedIn, all applications must be submitted through our official website (&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;monks.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks is seeking an experienced, thoughtful, and hands-on &lt;strong&gt;UI Designer&lt;/strong&gt; to lead the creation of exceptional digital products and design systems for some of the world&#39;s highest-profile brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you won&#39;t just be &quot;making things look pretty.&quot; You will be the architect of a major platform migration and component library overhaul for a large Fashion &amp;amp; Luxury brand. We need someone who has a deep love for design foundations and the technical rigor to build scalable systems that last. AI is at the forefront of our team processes and is used as a powerful design tool - curiosity and innovation are part of our DNA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Craft:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate brand values, creative concepts, UX documentation and user–stories into ground-breaking visual &amp;amp; functional design solutions. Go above and beyond the original brief to push what’s possible on both a creative and technical level. Design and customize existing components to align with rigorous brand standards, ensuring a perfect balance between visual flair and functional utility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem-Solve:&lt;/strong&gt; Employ your problem-solving skills and full stack of design solutions to guide projects from start, finish and everywhere in between to ensure the highest quality of the delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate:&lt;/strong&gt; Tackle high-end projects in collaboration with colleagues and clients alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to process:&lt;/strong&gt; Based on your experience and expertise, you can judge the quality of the user experience, and explain what needs to be achieved to make it better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain Quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Continuously enhance and push towards industry–leading execution, from concept through realisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audit &amp;amp; Strategise:&lt;/strong&gt; Perform initial audits of existing web ecosystems to inform business requirements. You will determine the most efficient approach for delivering new component libraries and defining complex migration strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish the initial design library template frameworks from the ground up, ensuring they are flexible, scalable, and technically sound.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Facilitation:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead and facilitate workshops with brand stakeholders to extract core brand guidelines and translate them into digital-first design principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prototyping:&lt;/strong&gt; Deliver high-fidelity, fully designed Figma prototypes that serve as the &quot;North Star&quot; for our development teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Narrative Building:&lt;/strong&gt; Shape and articulate convincing creative narratives and critical design rationale. You’ll present with passion to both internal teams and external stakeholders, substantiating your work with logic and data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; ~5+ years of relevant experience in digital design (web, app, and mobile). You have a portfolio that proves your visual prowess and your ability to handle complex system design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Precision:&lt;/strong&gt; A thorough understanding of design fundamentals—typography, interaction design, usability, grid systems, and color theory. You notice the pixel that’s out of place before anyone else does.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tooling Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Expert-level command of &lt;strong&gt;Figma&lt;/strong&gt; and Adobe Creative Suite. You are also expected to have a strong drive to master emerging &lt;strong&gt;AI tools&lt;/strong&gt; (such as Firefly, Claude Design, Claude Code, Chat GPT, Gemini) to optimise your workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organisation:&lt;/strong&gt; You are &quot;system-minded.&quot; You know how to organise files, layers, and documentation so that any designer or developer can jump in without getting lost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong communication skills and a &quot;feel&quot; for the politics of advertising. You understand that the best work comes from a mix of healthy critique and team kudos&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Monks, we believe in fostering an environment where a diversity of perspectives can thrive. We proactively work to design hiring processes that promote equity and inclusion while mitigating bias. We celebrate diversity and are committed to building a team that reflects the communities we serve. We welcome and encourage qualified applicants, from all backgrounds, who are excited to contribute to our mission.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
