&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range: &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$105,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$135,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Monks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks is the global, digital-first, data-driven, unitary operating brand of S4 Capital plc. With a legacy of innovation and specialized expertise, Monks combines an extraordinary range of global Marketing and Technology Services to redefine how brands interact with the world. Through Monks.Flow, its flagship AI ecosystem for marketing orchestration, Monks transforms marketing into a growth engine, collapsing timelines and connecting brands to culture in real time. By deploying bespoke intelligent agents across disciplines and delivering culturally relevant, high-impact creative and digital solutions, Monks solves key critical business challenges across the entire brand enterprise to help brands sustain long-term impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monks was named a Contender in The Forrester Wave™: Global Marketing Services, ranks among Cannes Lions&#39; Top 10 Creative Companies (2022-25) and remains the only partner featured in AdExchanger’s Programmatic Power Players list every year (2020-24). Named Adweek’s first AI Agency of the Year (2023) and The One Show’s inaugural AI Pioneer Organization, Monks was also awarded Business Intelligence Group’s 2025 Excellence in Artificial Intelligence Award in both the Organizational and AI Product categories. As a trusted partner to cutting-edge innovators in tech, Monks earned titles such as Optimizely Experimentation Partner of the Year (2025), runner-up for the Adobe Firefly Partner Award (2024), and Workato’s AI Visionary Customer Impact Award (2024). Additionally, Monks achieved a record-breaking number of FWAs and continues to hold the most of any partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to building a respectful and empowering work environment for all people to freely express themselves amongst colleagues who embrace diversity in all respects. Including fresh voices and unique points of view in all aspects of our business not only creates an environment where we can all grow and thrive but also increases our potential to produce work that better represents—and resonates with—the world around us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Please note that we will never request payment or bank account information at any stage of the recruitment process. As we continue to grow our teams, we urge you to be cautious of fraudulent job postings or recruitment activities that misuse our company name and information. Please protect your personal information during any recruitment process. While Monks may contact potential candidates via LinkedIn, all applications must be submitted through our official website (&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://monks.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;monks.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Monks is seeking a &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Visual Quality Analyst (QA)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; to join our global quality team supporting &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;one of the biggest clients in the world&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;. You’ll play a key role in ensuring visual excellence across large-scale digital campaigns and assets produced by cross-functional creative and production teams.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role requires an expert eye for design, deep knowledge of testing tools, and the ability to manage complex QA processes for high-volume, high-visibility creative output.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Role&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As a &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Visual QA&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;, you’ll be responsible for defining and executing testing strategies to ensure the highest level of quality across digital assets — including banners, images, and video content. You’ll collaborate closely with design, production, and engineering teams to identify visual inconsistencies, usability issues, and brand deviations before final delivery.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;You’ll take ownership of your projects end-to-end: from planning and testing to bug management and post-delivery verification. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Review and test a wide range of digital assets (banners, images, videos, and more) with exceptional precision and attention to detail.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Execute QA strategies and test plans for multiple concurrent projects, ensuring timely delivery and top-tier quality.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Identify, document, and prioritize bugs using standardized tracking tools; triage issues based on severity and impact.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Collaborate with designers, producers, and developers to resolve visual and technical issues efficiently.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Review specifications, brand guidelines, and design documents to anticipate potential quality risks.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Maintain fluent use of content&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Digital Asset Management (DAM)&lt;/strong&gt; systems for organizing, retrieving, and tracking digital content.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Troubleshoot issues within the DAM system and suggest process improvements.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Create and maintain comprehensive QA documentation, test plans, and visual validation checklists.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Support overall operational efficiency by suggesting process improvements in testing and bug management workflows.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work hands-on with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Photoshop, Adobe Premiere, Sketch, and other creative tools&lt;/strong&gt; to validate and analyze visual deliverables accurately.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Requirements&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in Quality Assurance or Testing, preferably within creative production, digital advertising, or post-production environments.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strong understanding of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;graphic design principles&lt;/strong&gt; and familiarity with tools such as &lt;strong&gt;Adobe Creative Cloud, Media Info, Frame.io, Photoshop, Adobe Premiere, and Sketch&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Hands-on experience with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;QA methodologies&lt;/strong&gt;, testing processes, and bug tracking systems (e.g., Jira, Trello, or similar).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Advanced attention to visual detail, with the ability to identify subtle inconsistencies across formats and platforms.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Proven ability to create, execute, and manage QA test plans for large-scale or complex campaigns.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strong collaboration skills; able to work cross-functionally with design, production, and technology teams.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills in English; Spanish fluency is a plus.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Proficiency in documentation creation, workflow mapping, and delivering training to larger groups.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Highly organized, proactive, and self-sufficient — capable of owning multiple QA tracks simultaneously.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Based in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Mexico City&lt;/strong&gt;, with availability to work from the office &lt;strong&gt;three days per week&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Proficient in English communication.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
