&lt;p&gt;Monks is seeking an English-speaking &lt;strong&gt;Visual QA Lead&lt;/strong&gt; to manage our quality assurance team and oversee the visual integrity of our work for a major international account. In this management role, you will be responsible for the entire QA operation, defining standards and leading a team of experts to excellence. If you are a leader with a design background who thrives in optimizing processes and managing high-performing teams, we’d love to have a look at your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role you will:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
