&lt;li&gt;Lead and coordinate the Visual QA team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and improve QA processes, standards, and workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage project allocations, priorities, and QA coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support hiring, onboarding, mentoring, and team development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with PMs, creatives, production teams, and stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review escalations, complex QA cases, and delivery risks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure documentation, reporting, and communication consistency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for measuring and tracking project quality KPIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and update metrics on a monthly cadence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share KPI reports and quality insights with relevant stakeholders regularly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience you already have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in Visual QA, Creative Production, or QA Operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous leadership or people management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of QA methodologies and creative workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Jira, DAM systems, Figma, and Adobe Creative Suite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, organizational, and stakeholder management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead teams, improve processes, and drive quality standards across projects&lt;/li&gt;
